<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:04.400" end="00:00:08.000" style="s2">Eyes up, people. The strongest woman on</p>
<p begin="00:00:06.400" end="00:00:10.080" style="s2">the boardwalk is right here. If I make</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.000" end="00:00:13.360" style="s2">your day, scan the tip sign or toss</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.080" end="00:00:15.839" style="s2">something in the jar.</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.360" end="00:00:18.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just my luck, sweetheart. Performing for</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.839" end="00:00:19.760" style="s2">tips. People will think I threw you out.</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.080" end="00:00:21.359" style="s2">Of course not. You only pulled my</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.760" end="00:00:24.720" style="s2">tuition, cut me off, and changed the</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.359" end="00:00:26.560" style="s2">locks. Totally different. Still sharp.</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.720" end="00:00:29.560" style="s2">Come with me. I brought you good news.</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.560" end="00:00:29.560" style="s2">Pass.</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.080" end="00:00:33.440" style="s2">Then keep passing on the chance to find</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.840" end="00:00:35.920" style="s2">your children. If you want to know where</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.440" end="00:00:39.239" style="s2">they are, you&#39;ll do exactly what I say.</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.920" end="00:00:39.239" style="s2">My children.</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.265" end="00:00:45.250" style="s2">[crying]</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.230" end="00:00:45.250" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.120" end="00:00:53.760" style="s2">You took them. I arranged it. And I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.079" end="00:00:55.920" style="s2">still the only person who can lead you</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.760" end="00:00:57.840" style="s2">to them.</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.920" end="00:01:00.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Careful. Hurt me and the trail dies with</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.840" end="00:01:00.480" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.520" end="00:01:05.920" style="s2">What do you want? Marry Ethan Cole. The</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.000" end="00:01:07.360" style="s2">man Sabrina was supposed to marry? The</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.920" end="00:01:09.280" style="s2">single dad your family keeps calling</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.360" end="00:01:11.119" style="s2">broke and disfigured? He has no money</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.280" end="00:01:14.000" style="s2">and he has two kids. My daughter</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.119" end="00:01:15.600" style="s2">deserves better. I&#39;m your daughter, too.</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.000" end="00:01:18.479" style="s2">You know what I mean? So, you want me to</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.600" end="00:01:22.240" style="s2">take Sabrina&#39;s place? Marry him and you</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.479" end="00:01:25.200" style="s2">get the full file. Do we have a deal?</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.240" end="00:01:28.200" style="s2">If that&#39;s your price, fine. I&#39;ll marry</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.200" end="00:01:28.200" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.759" end="00:01:39.439" style="s2">Dad, why do we look like we lost a fight</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.600" end="00:01:41.360" style="s2">with the thrift store? Because dad&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.439" end="00:01:42.799" style="s2">testing his bride. If she only sees</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.360" end="00:01:43.840" style="s2">money, better to know before the</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.799" end="00:01:46.240" style="s2">wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.840" end="00:01:49.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She could be your new mom. Nobody blows</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.240" end="00:01:49.479" style="s2">our cover.</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.159" end="00:01:53.439" style="s2">When the coals were down, the hails</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.920" end="00:01:55.840" style="s2">didn&#39;t just turn their backs. They made</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.439" end="00:01:57.520" style="s2">things worse. I built Apex Meridian</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.840" end="00:01:59.119" style="s2">without them. Now they expect me to go</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.520" end="00:02:01.520" style="s2">through with that marriage. I want to</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.119" end="00:02:03.520" style="s2">know who I&#39;m marrying first.</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.520" end="00:02:06.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, am I wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.520" end="00:02:09.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re being careful. That&#39;s not wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.799" end="00:02:12.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then stay in character. She can&#39;t know I</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.440" end="00:02:18.360" style="s2">have money or that the scar comes off.</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.080" end="00:02:18.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax. Your secret safe with us. Mhm.</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.720" end="00:02:29.120" style="s2">Leo, do we really have to pretend we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.280" end="00:02:32.640" style="s2">broke? Unless you want a stranger</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.120" end="00:02:35.640" style="s2">showing up and becoming our new mom. I</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.640" end="00:02:35.640" style="s2">don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.800" end="00:02:46.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So much for the hideous fiance.</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.120" end="00:02:53.000" style="s2">And I take that back.</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.599" end="00:03:07.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom. Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.480" end="00:03:07.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.840" end="00:03:17.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you calling me mom? Because you</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.920" end="00:03:19.599" style="s2">are Lily and I see you in our dreams all</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.920" end="00:03:20.480" style="s2">the time.</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.599" end="00:03:22.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You see me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.480" end="00:03:23.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re in a hospital. Everything&#39;s white</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.400" end="00:03:25.440" style="s2">and you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.280" end="00:03:27.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re Marqu Quinn. I&#39;m Ethan Cole. No</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.440" end="00:03:29.040" style="s2">house, one dying car in this face. But I</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.519" end="00:03:30.239" style="s2">still want a wife who&#39;s gorgeous, sweet,</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.040" end="00:03:32.480" style="s2">polished, and knows her way around a</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.239" end="00:03:34.480" style="s2">kitchen.</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.480" end="00:03:35.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarred, broke, and picky. Bold</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.480" end="00:03:37.920" style="s2">combination.</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.920" end="00:03:39.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ignore the sales pitch. Dad&#39;s actually</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.920" end="00:03:41.519" style="s2">great. He&#39;ll take care of you. And if</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.519" end="00:03:43.280" style="s2">you say jump, he&#39;ll ask how high.</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.519" end="00:03:45.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.280" end="00:03:46.799" style="s2">We agreed the broken scard act would</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.040" end="00:03:47.280" style="s2">scare her off. Why are you selling me</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.799" end="00:03:51.480" style="s2">now?</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.280" end="00:03:51.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You never said the bride was mom.</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.720" end="00:03:57.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad has a lot going for him. But his</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.640" end="00:03:57.920" style="s2">best feature,</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.040" end="00:03:59.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; what?</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.920" end="00:04:01.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He comes with two ridiculously adorable</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.920" end="00:04:02.720" style="s2">kids. Marry him and we&#39;re a package</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.760" end="00:04:04.720" style="s2">deal.</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.720" end="00:04:06.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo Cole, don&#39;t listen to him. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.720" end="00:04:08.080" style="s2">broke. I&#39;m scarred. And marrying me</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.400" end="00:04:09.840" style="s2">means a lifetime of trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.080" end="00:04:10.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, let&#39;s get the marriage</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.840" end="00:04:12.080" style="s2">license.</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.319" end="00:04:13.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Wait,</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.080" end="00:04:15.360" style="s2">what?</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.120" end="00:04:17.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I like [music] the kids. If you want</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.360" end="00:04:19.199" style="s2">this, too, let&#39;s do it.</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.680" end="00:04:22.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t even have my ID on me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.199" end="00:04:26.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah packed it.</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.720" end="00:04:26.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We brought it.</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.199" end="00:04:40.479" style="s2">I just married a man I barely know.</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.400" end="00:04:42.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Regretting it already.</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.479" end="00:04:43.680" style="s2">Say the word and we&#39;ll handle the</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.160" end="00:04:45.360" style="s2">separation properly.</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.680" end="00:04:48.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not leaving. Marriage wasn&#39;t the</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.360" end="00:04:49.759" style="s2">point. Finding my children is.</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.160" end="00:04:52.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, Dad&#39;s actually</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.759" end="00:04:52.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo.</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.360" end="00:04:57.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What was our deal?</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.240" end="00:05:00.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said the broken scarred act would</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.919" end="00:05:02.160" style="s2">make mom walk away. You&#39;re married now.</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.960" end="00:05:03.600" style="s2">Why keep lying?</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.160" end="00:05:05.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Being married doesn&#39;t mean I trust her</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.600" end="00:05:06.560" style="s2">yet.</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.120" end="00:05:07.280" style="s2">We might still decide this was a</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.560" end="00:05:09.360" style="s2">mistake.</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.280" end="00:05:11.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not leaving mom. When the coals</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.360" end="00:05:13.440" style="s2">were struggling, the hails kicked</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.128" end="00:05:14.960" style="s2">[music] us while we were down. What if</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.440" end="00:05:16.800" style="s2">she&#39;s here for something?</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.960" end="00:05:19.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom had nothing to do with what her</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.800" end="00:05:24.720" style="s2">family did back then. If she&#39;s giving us</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.600" end="00:05:27.840" style="s2">a chance now, it&#39;s because she wants to.</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.720" end="00:05:29.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You Hey. Hey. What happened? Tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.840" end="00:05:33.400" style="s2">I&#39;ll fix it.</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.120" end="00:05:33.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want you to leave, Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.320" end="00:05:40.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. Okay. I won&#39;t walk away. Not now.</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.320" end="00:05:42.560" style="s2">But we make a deal.</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.880" end="00:05:46.000" style="s2">You keep the money and the scar between</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.560" end="00:05:48.880" style="s2">us. I keep trying.</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.000" end="00:05:51.280" style="s2">No promises beyond that.</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.880" end="00:05:54.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.280" end="00:05:54.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.000" end="00:06:00.320" style="s2">She won&#39;t stay with a broke man with a</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.680" end="00:06:03.440" style="s2">scar forever. Leo and Lily will see I</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.320" end="00:06:05.680" style="s2">was right.</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.440" end="00:06:08.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, what are you three whispering</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.680" end="00:06:08.560" style="s2">about?</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.120" end="00:06:14.000" style="s2">Nothing. So, the kids and I are staying</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.160" end="00:06:15.840" style="s2">at your place tonight. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.000" end="00:06:18.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My place?</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.840" end="00:06:19.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m unemployed, remember? I can&#39;t afford</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.080" end="00:06:22.560" style="s2">rent. Where else would we go?</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.600" end="00:06:24.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine, you pay half the rent.</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.560" end="00:06:25.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re married. Do we really need to</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.000" end="00:06:27.520" style="s2">split every bill?</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.039" end="00:06:30.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Roommates split bills. Strangers who</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.520" end="00:06:34.960" style="s2">just got married definitely do.</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.319" end="00:06:37.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Doesn&#39;t matter. I have no money.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.960" end="00:06:39.554" style="s2">Lily and I are sleeping on the sidewalk</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.360" end="00:06:41.574" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.554" end="00:06:41.574" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.080" end="00:06:44.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. All right. You two can stay</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.000" end="00:06:48.680" style="s2">with me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.720" end="00:06:48.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She [music] actually said yes.</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.639" end="00:06:55.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is it. It&#39;s small, but we can make</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.560" end="00:06:55.960" style="s2">room for four.</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.319" end="00:07:06.319" style="s2">Ethan, write up a resume. I&#39;ll ask</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.720" end="00:07:08.560" style="s2">around and find out who&#39;s hiring. When</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.319" end="00:07:10.240" style="s2">something opens up, you take it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.560" end="00:07:13.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A job?</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.240" end="00:07:14.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. Raising kids costs money.</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.120" end="00:07:16.800" style="s2">Preschool for two can swallow most of a</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.880" end="00:07:18.639" style="s2">paycheck. I can&#39;t carry all four of us</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.800" end="00:07:20.080" style="s2">alone.</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.639" end="00:07:20.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;d pay for their school?</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.080" end="00:07:22.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.960" end="00:07:25.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re not yours.</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.639" end="00:07:28.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I married you. Your kids are my family</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.120" end="00:07:28.440" style="s2">now, too.</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.720" end="00:07:30.960" style="s2">Go pick something to watch. Mom&#39;s making</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.479" end="00:07:33.199" style="s2">dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.960" end="00:07:35.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll help. Me, too.</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.199" end="00:07:38.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll wash the celery. I get the</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.440" end="00:07:38.440" style="s2">tomatoes.</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.125" end="00:07:43.145" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.919" end="00:07:53.479" style="s2">Dinner&#39;s ready.</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.599" end="00:07:58.160" style="s2">Mom, try a rib. You need some meat on</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.599" end="00:08:01.039" style="s2">you</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.160" end="00:08:03.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; and have some soup.</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.039" end="00:08:05.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re such good kids. I just wish they</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.680" end="00:08:08.560" style="s2">were mine.</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.039" end="00:08:10.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, what happened? You look sad.</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.560" end="00:08:11.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing happened. Mom&#39;s fine. Now you</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.319" end="00:08:12.879" style="s2">two eat, too.</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.280" end="00:08:14.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You two forgetting someone?</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.879" end="00:08:18.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want some, too? You&#39;ve got hands,</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.720" end="00:08:18.680" style="s2">Dad. She&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.599" end="00:08:23.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Naturally. But there is something I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.599" end="00:08:26.240" style="s2">been meaning to ask you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.280" end="00:08:28.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead. I&#39;m broke, scarred, and</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.240" end="00:08:31.280" style="s2">raising twins. Why did you marry me?</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.960" end="00:08:32.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marriage is a partnership. I needed one,</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.280" end="00:08:33.599" style="s2">and you seem decent. The rest doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.959" end="00:08:35.200" style="s2">matter to me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.599" end="00:08:37.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what do you think of me so far?</p>
<p begin="00:08:35.200" end="00:08:41.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re decent. A little too comfortable</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.120" end="00:08:41.159" style="s2">eating my food without a job.</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.640" end="00:08:46.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is this?</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.080" end="00:08:49.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s me. I married Ethan, just like you</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.800" end="00:08:50.560" style="s2">demanded. Now tell me where my children</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.040" end="00:08:52.560" style="s2">are.</p>
<p begin="00:08:50.560" end="00:08:55.200" style="s2">Well,</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.560" end="00:08:58.416" style="s2">Vanessa Hail, you know what happens when</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.200" end="00:08:59.040" style="s2">I lose patience?</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.416" end="00:09:01.839" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.040" end="00:09:03.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s the rush? Give me a few days.</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.839" end="00:09:06.200" style="s2">I&#39;ll tell you where they are when I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.200" end="00:09:06.200" style="s2">ready.</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.920" end="00:09:17.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They actually fit.</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.680" end="00:09:20.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You live alone. Why do you have kids</p>
<p begin="00:09:17.519" end="00:09:22.320" style="s2">pajamas? I bought them for my twins.</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.480" end="00:09:24.560" style="s2">They&#39;d be about Leo and Lily&#39;s age now,</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.320" end="00:09:26.320" style="s2">but they&#39;re not here to wear them.</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.560" end="00:09:27.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry. I shouldn&#39;t have brought it</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.320" end="00:09:29.200" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.519" end="00:09:30.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s okay. You and the kids take my</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.200" end="00:09:33.040" style="s2">room. I&#39;ll sleep in the other one.</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.480" end="00:09:34.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, can Leo and I sleep with you?</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.040" end="00:09:36.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With me?</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.399" end="00:09:37.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily, don&#39;t you like sleeping with dad</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.560" end="00:09:39.600" style="s2">anymore?</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.279" end="00:09:40.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love you, Dad. I just want mom more</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.600" end="00:09:45.160" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.800" end="00:09:45.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then maybe the kids can sleep with me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.920" end="00:09:56.480" style="s2">Leo, Lily, breakfast.</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.839" end="00:09:58.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One thing. I have a job interview today.</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.480" end="00:09:59.920" style="s2">Can you watch the kids?</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.320" end="00:10:01.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve known each other for one day and</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.920" end="00:10:03.360" style="s2">you&#39;re leaving your kids with me. What</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.519" end="00:10:05.760" style="s2">if I&#39;m a kidnapper?</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.360" end="00:10:08.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not worried. Lily can protect her</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.760" end="00:10:08.760" style="s2">brother.</p>
<p begin="00:10:19.519" end="00:10:23.320" style="s2">Good morning, Mr. Cole.</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.519" end="00:10:28.720" style="s2">I leave town for a few days and you get</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.839" end="00:10:30.880" style="s2">married. [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.720" end="00:10:32.800" style="s2">What&#39;s she like? She&#39;s all right. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.880" end="00:10:34.399" style="s2">good to Leo and Lily. Victor Lawson</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.800" end="00:10:35.519" style="s2">invited you to the Lawson Hotel&#39;s gala</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.399" end="00:10:39.920" style="s2">tonight. Should I accept?</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.519" end="00:10:41.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Accept it? Yes, sir. Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.920" end="00:10:43.360" style="s2">Have HR put me through the regular</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.519" end="00:10:45.680" style="s2">onboarding for a lobby security job.</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.360" end="00:10:47.760" style="s2">Background check, training, all of it. I</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.680" end="00:10:50.422" style="s2">need a job I can actually show up for. A</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.760" end="00:10:53.640" style="s2">security job for you. You heard me.</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.422" end="00:10:53.640" style="s2">[music] Go.</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.680" end="00:10:57.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You married a man you&#39;d met once and one</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.519" end="00:10:59.519" style="s2">who was not exactly easy on the eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:10:57.680" end="00:11:01.120" style="s2">What choice did I have? Vanessa used my</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.519" end="00:11:03.680" style="s2">children&#39;s whereabouts to force me into</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.120" end="00:11:05.440" style="s2">it. Vanessa&#39;s vile. If I see her, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.680" end="00:11:07.519" style="s2">forget her. You asked me to find you</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.440" end="00:11:10.000" style="s2">work, right? Lost and hotels need event</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.519" end="00:11:12.720" style="s2">servers tonight. $250 for the shift.</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.000" end="00:11:16.720" style="s2">$250? Seriously?</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.720" end="00:11:21.440" style="s2">Hey, husband. Are you free tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.720" end="00:11:24.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Husband, I have plans tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.440" end="00:11:26.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is it important?</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.320" end="00:11:28.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very.</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.640" end="00:11:30.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s it. My husband has something</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.880" end="00:11:34.519" style="s2">important tonight, so he can&#39;t take the</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.560" end="00:11:34.519" style="s2">kids. I can&#39;t work the gala.</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.959" end="00:11:38.560" style="s2">The staffing agency arranged a kids&#39;</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.640" end="00:11:39.920" style="s2">room with a sitter. Bring them along.</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.560" end="00:11:42.920" style="s2">There&#39;ll be plenty of security at the</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.920" end="00:11:42.920" style="s2">gala.</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.519" end="00:11:47.600" style="s2">Stay here and have fun.</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.920" end="00:11:48.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll come get you when my shift ends.</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.600" end="00:11:52.440" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.640" end="00:11:52.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.480" end="00:12:00.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t mom say to stay here?</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.560" end="00:12:03.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom just doesn&#39;t want us wandering off.</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.800" end="00:12:05.519" style="s2">She&#39;s worried someone might take us. But</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.120" end="00:12:09.440" style="s2">we&#39;re not scared of kidnappers, are we?</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.519" end="00:12:13.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. If anyone tries, I&#39;ll hit them.</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.440" end="00:12:16.079" style="s2">The CEO of Apex Meridian is coming.</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.440" end="00:12:18.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The CEO of Apex Meridian, he&#39;s one of</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.079" end="00:12:20.800" style="s2">the richest men in the country. Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.560" end="00:12:24.360" style="s2">If he notices us, we might never have to</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.800" end="00:12:24.360" style="s2">carry another tray.</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.000" end="00:12:31.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome, Mr. Cole.</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.399" end="00:12:35.399" style="s2">Ethan</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.639" end="00:12:45.760" style="s2">Mara, do you know the CEO of Apex</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.880" end="00:12:47.519" style="s2">Meridian? No. From the side, he looked a</p>
<p begin="00:12:45.760" end="00:12:48.880" style="s2">little like my husband, but only from</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.519" end="00:12:50.320" style="s2">the side. My husband isn&#39;t that</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.880" end="00:12:51.360" style="s2">handsome. And here, I thought I was</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.320" end="00:12:52.720" style="s2">about to become best friends with a</p>
<p begin="00:12:51.360" end="00:12:54.639" style="s2">billionaire&#39;s wife. Guess I&#39;m still</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.720" end="00:12:56.399" style="s2">working for a living. I&#39;m sorry I failed</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.639" end="00:12:59.040" style="s2">to marry a billionaire and finance your</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.399" end="00:13:00.399" style="s2">retirement. You&#39;re impossible. Come on,</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.040" end="00:13:03.040" style="s2">before the supervisor catches us</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.399" end="00:13:05.279" style="s2">standing around.</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.040" end="00:13:07.839" style="s2">That was close. But what is she doing</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.279" end="00:13:09.440" style="s2">here?</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.839" end="00:13:10.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Cole, do you know that [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.440" end="00:13:12.000" style="s2">server?</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.800" end="00:13:14.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.000" end="00:13:19.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He obviously knows her. Why pretend he</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.240" end="00:13:19.079" style="s2">doesn&#39;t? I&#39;ll never understand that man.</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.560" end="00:13:26.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, this is what a Lawson Hotels gala</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.480" end="00:13:28.240" style="s2">looks like. It&#39;s gorgeous. Thank you,</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.720" end="00:13:29.680" style="s2">Brandon. I&#39;d never get a glimpse of this</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.240" end="00:13:31.279" style="s2">world without you. [music] Then you can</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.680" end="00:13:33.680" style="s2">thank me properly tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.279" end="00:13:35.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re so bad.</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.680" end="00:13:37.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, [music] isn&#39;t that Mara?</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.760" end="00:13:42.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I already dumped her. Did you take a</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.839" end="00:13:42.200" style="s2">serving job just to follow me here?</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.880" end="00:13:49.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect. Of all the people in Los</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.720" end="00:13:49.160" style="s2">Angeles, I had to run into these two.</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.040" end="00:13:56.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sabrina, your stepsister, and Brendan,</p>
<p begin="00:13:54.000" end="00:14:00.320" style="s2">your ex. Those two are together now.</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.880" end="00:14:00.320" style="s2">They&#39;re not worth it. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.639" end="00:14:04.240" style="s2">Mara, why are you running off? I was</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.720" end="00:14:06.800" style="s2">going to ask why you&#39;re serving tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.240" end="00:14:10.880" style="s2">Are you short on money? You could have</p>
<p begin="00:14:06.800" end="00:14:13.120" style="s2">called me. I&#39;d help. Really? Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.880" end="00:14:14.639" style="s2">You&#39;re my sister. Watching you carry</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.120" end="00:14:15.600" style="s2">trays and wait on people breaks my</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.639" end="00:14:17.360" style="s2">heart.</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.600" end="00:14:19.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sabrina, you&#39;re too kind.</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.360" end="00:14:24.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brendan, [music] disgusting. Since</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.519" end="00:14:24.279" style="s2">you&#39;re so generous, start with $25,000.</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.880" end="00:14:29.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 25,000? I don&#39;t have that kind of money.</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.600" end="00:14:32.519" style="s2">No. [music] Fine. Give me whatever you</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.519" end="00:14:32.519" style="s2">have.</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.959" end="00:14:36.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing? That&#39;s robbery.</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.639" end="00:14:39.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Robbery? You just said you wanted to</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.959" end="00:14:42.000" style="s2">help. I do, but you can&#39;t demand 20 or</p>
<p begin="00:14:39.199" end="00:14:43.600" style="s2">$30,000. Who can afford that? Dad set</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.000" end="00:14:44.959" style="s2">aside that money for my tuition and</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.600" end="00:14:46.560" style="s2">living expenses. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.959" end="00:14:49.839" style="s2">It disappeared after your mother moved</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.560" end="00:14:52.560" style="s2">in. That bag costs thousands. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:49.839" end="00:14:55.600" style="s2">Did you buy it with my college fund?</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.560" end="00:14:57.040" style="s2">This? It&#39;s a knockoff.</p>
<p begin="00:14:55.600" end="00:15:00.800" style="s2">By the way, I heard you got married</p>
<p begin="00:14:57.040" end="00:15:01.920" style="s2">right after Brendan left you for me.</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.800" end="00:15:06.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara got married?</p>
<p begin="00:15:01.920" end="00:15:06.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She did. And wait until you see him.</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.440" end="00:15:12.160" style="s2">This is Mara&#39;s husband, Ethan Cole.</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.000" end="00:15:14.560" style="s2">What? Am I wrong? Look at that scar</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.160" end="00:15:16.399" style="s2">here. Everyone, take a look. That scar</p>
<p begin="00:15:14.560" end="00:15:17.600" style="s2">is rough.</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.399" end="00:15:19.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone married him.</p>
<p begin="00:15:17.600" end="00:15:20.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That photo can&#39;t be flattering. His face</p>
<p begin="00:15:19.279" end="00:15:23.600" style="s2">looks wrecked.</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.240" end="00:15:25.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why marry a man who looks like that?</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.600" end="00:15:27.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Money. What else? Turn off the lights</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.760" end="00:15:32.120" style="s2">and it won&#39;t matter.</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.760" end="00:15:32.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. All of you.</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.240" end="00:15:37.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re bullying mom. Lily, come on.</p>
<p begin="00:15:33.839" end="00:15:39.760" style="s2">We&#39;re helping her. Dad, are you coming?</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.199" end="00:15:41.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sabrina Hail is her stepsister. Is that</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.760" end="00:15:44.079" style="s2">why the Hail sent Mara instead?</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.839" end="00:15:45.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, Lily. If dad won&#39;t go, we will.</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.079" end="00:15:46.800" style="s2">Bad, Dad. I&#39;m not talking to you</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.839" end="00:15:49.519" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.800" end="00:15:53.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who said I wasn&#39;t going?</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.519" end="00:15:56.480" style="s2">Mara, how could you do this to yourself?</p>
<p begin="00:15:53.920" end="00:15:59.440" style="s2">Marrying a man everyone laughs at.</p>
<p begin="00:15:56.480" end="00:16:03.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow. The confidence of a mediocre man.</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.440" end="00:16:03.399" style="s2">Have you always been like this?</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.759" end="00:16:07.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brendan, don&#39;t take it personally. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:16:06.079" end="00:16:10.000" style="s2">miserable about her husband, so she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.519" end="00:16:11.360" style="s2">lashing out. Mara, you can&#39;t dump your</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.000" end="00:16:15.399" style="s2">unhappiness on us.</p>
<p begin="00:16:11.360" end="00:16:15.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s laughing at my dad?</p>
<p begin="00:16:22.399" end="00:16:28.199" style="s2">That&#39;s Ethan.</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.240" end="00:16:28.199" style="s2">But Ethan has a scar.</p>
<p begin="00:16:33.680" end="00:16:37.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.800" end="00:16:40.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Leo Cole. This is my sister, Lily.</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.839" end="00:16:42.160" style="s2">And this is our dad, Ethan Cole. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:16:40.399" end="00:16:44.880" style="s2">married to my mom.</p>
<p begin="00:16:42.160" end="00:16:47.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How is he this handsome?</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.880" end="00:16:48.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s Ethan Cole. You said your husband</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.199" end="00:16:51.040" style="s2">wasn&#39;t exactly handsome. I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:16:48.959" end="00:16:52.079" style="s2">understand. He looked completely</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.040" end="00:16:55.120" style="s2">different before.</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.079" end="00:16:56.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who called my dad ugly? Step forward.</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.120" end="00:16:59.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did. So what?</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.880" end="00:17:04.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then open your eyes. Look at my dad. Now</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.440" end="00:17:04.279" style="s2">look at Brandon. Who&#39;s the ugly one?</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.199" end="00:17:08.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No contest. Ethan is far better looking.</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.280" end="00:17:10.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That photo had to be fake. He looks</p>
<p begin="00:17:08.559" end="00:17:11.520" style="s2">nothing like it. If the photo was fake,</p>
<p begin="00:17:10.000" end="00:17:13.120" style="s2">maybe the rest was too. Maybe the</p>
<p begin="00:17:11.520" end="00:17:15.566" style="s2">stepsitter stole Mara&#39;s boyfriend and</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.120" end="00:17:16.720" style="s2">rewrote the story.</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.566" end="00:17:18.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell]</p>
<p begin="00:17:16.720" end="00:17:20.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is all your fault, you little</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.240" end="00:17:21.919" style="s2">bastard.</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.240" end="00:17:22.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo, are you hurt? Tell me where it</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.919" end="00:17:26.839" style="s2">hurts.</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.400" end="00:17:26.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m okay, Mom. Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.880" end="00:17:29.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re shoving kids now, Sabrina. How</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.559" end="00:17:33.160" style="s2">low can you go?</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.520" end="00:17:33.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He deserves it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.799" end="00:17:38.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need an ambulance. A child was pushed</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.720" end="00:17:41.080" style="s2">to the floor in the Lawson Hotel</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.080" end="00:17:41.080" style="s2">Ballroom.</p>
<p begin="00:17:41.280" end="00:17:43.760" style="s2">You called 911 over one little shove.</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.732" end="00:17:45.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.760" end="00:17:48.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re pathetic.</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.919" end="00:17:51.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The paramedics are for Leo.</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.640" end="00:17:54.000" style="s2">The police are for you. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.039" end="00:17:55.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing, Brandon? Stop her.</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.000" end="00:17:57.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara, for my s.</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.600" end="00:17:59.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve wanted to do that for years. And</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.520" end="00:18:01.360" style="s2">stop telling people you dumped me. I</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.760" end="00:18:03.039" style="s2">caught you cheating with Sabrina, so I</p>
<p begin="00:18:01.360" end="00:18:05.520" style="s2">ended it. You&#39;ve been lying about our</p>
<p begin="00:18:03.039" end="00:18:07.600" style="s2">breakup ever since.</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.520" end="00:18:09.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is wrong with you? I&#39;m your sister.</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.600" end="00:18:11.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stepsister. Your mom had an affair with</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.840" end="00:18:13.440" style="s2">my dad, then moved into our home. My</p>
<p begin="00:18:11.760" end="00:18:15.280" style="s2">mother never recovered and I haven&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:18:13.440" end="00:18:19.320" style="s2">forgotten any of it.</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.280" end="00:18:19.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad will make you pay for this.</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.080" end="00:18:27.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Security, help.</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.600" end="00:18:28.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry about the scene. Family drama.</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.600" end="00:18:30.320" style="s2">Please enjoy the rest of the gala.</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.960" end="00:18:33.320" style="s2">Security can take it from here.</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.320" end="00:18:33.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.320" end="00:18:41.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is going on? I hosted this gala to</p>
<p begin="00:18:39.360" end="00:18:43.360" style="s2">welcome Mr. Cole. If this spectacle</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.520" end="00:18:46.360" style="s2">reaches him, everyone responsible is</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.360" end="00:18:46.360" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.543" end="00:18:53.360" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.120" end="00:18:56.559" style="s2">Mr. Lawson,</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.360" end="00:18:58.480" style="s2">and you are Brandon Shaw. My father run</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.559" end="00:19:00.080" style="s2">Shaw Development. We met here when you</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.480" end="00:19:03.120" style="s2">had a business meeting with my father.</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.080" end="00:19:04.720" style="s2">Oh, right.</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.120" end="00:19:06.880" style="s2">So, you decided to start a fight at my</p>
<p begin="00:19:04.720" end="00:19:09.039" style="s2">gala. Give me one reason security</p>
<p begin="00:19:06.880" end="00:19:11.520" style="s2">shouldn&#39;t remove you. I didn&#39;t start</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.039" end="00:19:13.468" style="s2">anything. She did. She begged me to take</p>
<p begin="00:19:11.520" end="00:19:13.840" style="s2">her back. I refused and she went crazy.</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.468" end="00:19:15.280" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.840" end="00:19:17.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brendan, you could make a career out of</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.280" end="00:19:19.280" style="s2">twisting the truth. He&#39;s telling the</p>
<p begin="00:19:17.039" end="00:19:20.559" style="s2">truth. Mr. Lawson, I&#39;m her sister. I</p>
<p begin="00:19:19.280" end="00:19:23.039" style="s2">should be defending her, but she went</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.559" end="00:19:24.880" style="s2">too far. I have to be honest.</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.039" end="00:19:26.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You struck a guest at my gala. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:24.880" end="00:19:28.640" style="s2">Everyone involved stays here until I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.480" end="00:19:30.080" style="s2">seen the footage and the police arrive.</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.640" end="00:19:31.520" style="s2">Keep her here. Preserve the ballroom</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.080" end="00:19:34.320" style="s2">footage.</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.520" end="00:19:37.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody touches mom. Nobody.</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.320" end="00:19:41.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch them. Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.840" end="00:19:41.400" style="s2">And who are</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.400" end="00:19:48.200" style="s2">Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.200" end="00:19:48.200" style="s2">Cole?</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.880" end="00:19:55.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Cole.</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.880" end="00:19:57.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Cole is here. Where? I don&#39;t see</p>
<p begin="00:19:55.520" end="00:20:00.000" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.200" end="00:20:01.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. Right. I was wondering why Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.000" end="00:20:03.280" style="s2">Cole still hasn&#39;t arrived. That&#39;s That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.440" end="00:20:05.679" style="s2">what I meant. Now, where were we? I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.280" end="00:20:07.360" style="s2">like to file a complaint.</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.679" end="00:20:10.000" style="s2">A complaint about what?</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.360" end="00:20:11.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those two harassed my wife.</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.000" end="00:20:13.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They harassed your wife.</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.360" end="00:20:15.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My wife was doing her job. They mocked</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.600" end="00:20:19.799" style="s2">my face, humiliated her, and then</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.520" end="00:20:19.799" style="s2">Sabrina shoved our son to the floor.</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.320" end="00:20:24.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She pushed my brother down.</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.520" end="00:20:30.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Lawson, everyone says you&#39;re fair.</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.200" end="00:20:32.080" style="s2">I&#39;m sure you&#39;ll review the footage and</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.640" end="00:20:34.799" style="s2">handle this properly.</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.080" end="00:20:37.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please handle it fairly, Mr. Mr. Lawson</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.799" end="00:20:37.799" style="s2">fairly.</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.799" end="00:20:42.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Lawson, that&#39;s not what happened. I</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.120" end="00:20:45.840" style="s2">never</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.880" end="00:20:47.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; enough security. Escort them out of the</p>
<p begin="00:20:45.840" end="00:20:49.120" style="s2">ballroom. Save all the security footage</p>
<p begin="00:20:47.919" end="00:20:51.679" style="s2">and give it to the police when they</p>
<p begin="00:20:49.120" end="00:20:53.840" style="s2">arrive.</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.679" end="00:20:55.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let security handle it. This stopped</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.840" end="00:20:56.400" style="s2">being a family matter when she shoved a</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.440" end="00:21:00.200" style="s2">child.</p>
<p begin="00:20:56.400" end="00:21:00.200" style="s2"></p>
<p begin="00:21:01.440" end="00:21:06.480" style="s2">Mom, you were amazing tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.240" end="00:21:07.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I go too far tonight? You don&#39;t hate</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.480" end="00:21:09.440" style="s2">me for it, do you?</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.440" end="00:21:13.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, Mom. You stopped them because they</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.440" end="00:21:17.600" style="s2">heard us. We love you even more now.</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.760" end="00:21:18.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Because I Wait, you said you had</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.600" end="00:21:20.240" style="s2">something important tonight. Why were</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.799" end="00:21:22.640" style="s2">you at the Lawson Gala?</p>
<p begin="00:21:20.240" end="00:21:24.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you I had an interview. I got</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.640" end="00:21:28.080" style="s2">hired to drive an executive. He attended</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.960" end="00:21:31.019" style="s2">the gala, so I drove him there.</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.080" end="00:21:31.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You got the job. What does it pay?</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.019" end="00:21:33.280" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.200" end="00:21:34.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m supposed to be broke. Better keep</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.280" end="00:21:36.480" style="s2">the number modest.</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.880" end="00:21:40.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 5,000 a month.</p>
<p begin="00:21:36.480" end="00:21:42.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 5,000. Executive drivers make that much.</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.240" end="00:21:44.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that a lot? Maybe rich people don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.480" end="00:21:46.960" style="s2">care what things cost.</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.320" end="00:21:49.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s how it works. The poor keep</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.960" end="00:21:50.240" style="s2">scrambling and the rich barely notice</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.200" end="00:21:51.679" style="s2">the cost.</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.240" end="00:21:52.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As my wife, aren&#39;t you going to ask what</p>
<p begin="00:21:51.679" end="00:21:55.039" style="s2">happened to my face?</p>
<p begin="00:21:52.720" end="00:21:56.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will, but first I have to deal with my</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.039" end="00:21:58.799" style="s2">dad.</p>
<p begin="00:21:56.400" end="00:22:01.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father? Every time Sabrina and I</p>
<p begin="00:21:58.799" end="00:22:05.799" style="s2">fight, Dad takes her side. By now, he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:22:01.440" end="00:22:05.799" style="s2">probably waiting outside my front door.</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.320" end="00:22:13.200" style="s2">Dad, I know she&#39;s my sister and I should</p>
<p begin="00:22:10.720" end="00:22:15.280" style="s2">let things go, but she attacked Brendan</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.200" end="00:22:17.440" style="s2">and me at the Lawson Gala. She</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.280" end="00:22:18.480" style="s2">humiliated him so badly he almost broke</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.440" end="00:22:20.799" style="s2">up with me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.480" end="00:22:22.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara went too far this time. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.799" end="00:22:23.360" style="s2">worry, I&#39;ll make sure she answers for</p>
<p begin="00:22:22.880" end="00:22:26.159" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.360" end="00:22:27.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe let it go. She&#39;s still my sister.</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.159" end="00:22:28.799" style="s2">No matter what she does, I should</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.840" end="00:22:30.640" style="s2">forgive her.</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.799" end="00:22:32.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re too soft-hearted. That&#39;s why she</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.640" end="00:22:36.360" style="s2">keeps bullying you. This time, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.400" end="00:22:36.360" style="s2">standing up for you. Goodbye.</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.679" end="00:22:46.799" style="s2">Mara Quinn, why did you attack Sabrina?</p>
<p begin="00:22:45.280" end="00:22:47.840" style="s2">What could your own sister have done to</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.799" end="00:22:50.400" style="s2">deserve that?</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.840" end="00:22:51.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vanessa told me Mara agreed to this. Now</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.400" end="00:22:53.600" style="s2">I&#39;m not so sure.</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.520" end="00:22:56.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, please. We&#39;re standing outside.</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.600" end="00:22:58.880" style="s2">Let&#39;s go in and talk calmly. Who are you</p>
<p begin="00:22:56.480" end="00:23:01.840" style="s2">and why are you with my daughter? Ethan</p>
<p begin="00:22:58.880" end="00:23:03.280" style="s2">Cole, your legal son-in-law. Leo Lily,</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.840" end="00:23:05.440" style="s2">say hello to your grandfather.</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.280" end="00:23:08.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello, Grandpa. Hi, Grandpa.</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.440" end="00:23:11.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan Cole, wasn&#39;t Sabrina supposed to</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.080" end="00:23:13.120" style="s2">marry you? Mara, you stole your sister&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.039" end="00:23:14.640" style="s2">fianceé. Since you were children, you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.120" end="00:23:17.200" style="s2">always taken what belongs to her. Now</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.640" end="00:23:19.679" style="s2">you&#39;re taking men, too.</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.200" end="00:23:21.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Same old story. You blame me before you</p>
<p begin="00:23:19.679" end="00:23:23.280" style="s2">even hear the facts.</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.200" end="00:23:26.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watch your tone. This is the tone you</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.280" end="00:23:28.799" style="s2">get. Listen carefully. Sabrina thought</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.480" end="00:23:31.280" style="s2">Ethan was poor, scarred, and burdened</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.799" end="00:23:32.960" style="s2">with twins. She refused him. Vanessa</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.280" end="00:23:34.720" style="s2">used my missing children&#39;s whereabouts</p>
<p begin="00:23:32.960" end="00:23:35.840" style="s2">to force me to take her place and marry</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.720" end="00:23:39.760" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:23:35.840" end="00:23:41.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Poor, yes, but scarred. Look at him.</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.760" end="00:23:43.039" style="s2">Vanessa found you a perfectly good</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.440" end="00:23:46.960" style="s2">husband, and you&#39;re attacking her</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.039" end="00:23:50.080" style="s2">because he doesn&#39;t have money.</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.960" end="00:23:54.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your relationship with him is strained.</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.080" end="00:23:54.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not strained. Terrible.</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.559" end="00:24:03.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let me handle this.</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.400" end="00:24:05.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. I can&#39;t control you. Just answer</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.440" end="00:24:07.440" style="s2">one question. Why did you attack</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.520" end="00:24:10.000" style="s2">Sabrina?</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.440" end="00:24:12.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because she had it coming. Ask your</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.000" end="00:24:15.360" style="s2">other daughter what she did.</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.960" end="00:24:17.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did ask.</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.360" end="00:24:19.520" style="s2">You were jealous because Brandon chose</p>
<p begin="00:24:17.200" end="00:24:21.840" style="s2">her. So you caused a scene trying to</p>
<p begin="00:24:19.520" end="00:24:24.840" style="s2">break him. Sir, this really is Mara&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:24:21.840" end="00:24:24.840" style="s2">fault.</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.000" end="00:24:30.480" style="s2">But even if Mara was wrong, she&#39;s still</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.000" end="00:24:32.320" style="s2">your daughter. So what? I have always</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.480" end="00:24:33.679" style="s2">been fair. If my daughter&#39;s in the</p>
<p begin="00:24:32.320" end="00:24:36.159" style="s2">wrong, I&#39;ll hold her accountable like</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.679" end="00:24:39.200" style="s2">anyone else. Good. That&#39;s exactly what I</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.159" end="00:24:41.200" style="s2">needed to hear.</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.200" end="00:24:43.520" style="s2">What is this? The gala footage shoving</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.200" end="00:24:45.600" style="s2">Leo to the floor.</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.520" end="00:24:47.919" style="s2">How did you get hotel security footage?</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.600" end="00:24:49.360" style="s2">I filed the complaint. Mr. Dr. Lawson&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.919" end="00:24:51.279" style="s2">team sent the relevant clip and preserve</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.360" end="00:24:52.559" style="s2">the full footage for police. You said</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.279" end="00:24:55.039" style="s2">you&#39;d hold your daughter accountable.</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.559" end="00:24:57.279" style="s2">That goes for Sabrina, too. You set me</p>
<p begin="00:24:55.039" end="00:24:59.520" style="s2">up. I only asked you to apply your own</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.279" end="00:25:01.200" style="s2">rule and think twice before threatening</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.520" end="00:25:03.440" style="s2">my family. There&#39;s already a record of</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.200" end="00:25:05.120" style="s2">what happens. You shameless little. I</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.440" end="00:25:06.960" style="s2">ought to teach you a lesson. I won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.120" end="00:25:08.640" style="s2">fight my wife&#39;s father, but I trained</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.960" end="00:25:10.240" style="s2">for years and I won&#39;t let you hit Mara</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.640" end="00:25:10.880" style="s2">or the children. So, let&#39;s keep this a</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.240" end="00:25:12.240" style="s2">conversation.</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.880" end="00:25:13.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have things to do. I&#39;m not wasting</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.240" end="00:25:15.360" style="s2">another minute on this.</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.600" end="00:25:18.362" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Already leaving. We haven&#39;t seen the</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.360" end="00:25:18.362" style="s2">full footage yet. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.559" end="00:25:24.159" style="s2">You really have footage from the gala?</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.559" end="00:25:26.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I filed a complaint as a husband and</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.159" end="00:25:30.000" style="s2">parent. Lawson&#39;s team sent me the clip.</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.320" end="00:25:33.720" style="s2">That&#39;s all. Now tell me what happened</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.000" end="00:25:33.720" style="s2">between you and your family.</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.679" end="00:25:43.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo, Lily, why don&#39;t you go take a bath?</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.320" end="00:25:43.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.559" end="00:25:48.080" style="s2">Vanessa brought Sabrina into our home</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.159" end="00:25:49.760" style="s2">when I was little. Sabrina was only a</p>
<p begin="00:25:48.080" end="00:25:51.440" style="s2">year younger than me. My mother never</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.760" end="00:25:52.960" style="s2">recovered from the betrayal. As soon as</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.440" end="00:25:53.600" style="s2">I could support myself, I left and lived</p>
<p begin="00:25:52.960" end="00:25:55.279" style="s2">on my own.</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.600" end="00:25:57.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sabrina&#39;s only a year younger, but that</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.279" end="00:25:59.039" style="s2">doesn&#39;t prove big. We need marriage</p>
<p begin="00:25:57.039" end="00:26:00.720" style="s2">records. But if Vanessa took the</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.039" end="00:26:02.960" style="s2">education account your father set aside,</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.720" end="00:26:04.640" style="s2">there may be a paper trail.</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.960" end="00:26:07.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After I left, I thought I was done with</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.640" end="00:26:09.600" style="s2">them. Then Vanessa found me. She used</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.919" end="00:26:11.279" style="s2">information about my missing children to</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.600" end="00:26:12.480" style="s2">force me to marry you in Sabrina&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.279" end="00:26:16.679" style="s2">place.</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.480" end="00:26:16.679" style="s2">Vanessa knows where your twins are.</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.000" end="00:26:21.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My twins were taken right after they</p>
<p begin="00:26:19.520" end="00:26:23.039" style="s2">were born. I&#39;ve searched for them for</p>
<p begin="00:26:21.200" end="00:26:24.960" style="s2">years and found nothing. Vanessa was the</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.039" end="00:26:26.240" style="s2">first to say she knew where they were.</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.960" end="00:26:27.679" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.240" end="00:26:30.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, you married me because you were</p>
<p begin="00:26:27.679" end="00:26:34.480" style="s2">forced. Not because you knew I had I</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.640" end="00:26:36.159" style="s2">mean, not because you liked me.</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.480" end="00:26:39.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You made yourself look terrifying. Who</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.159" end="00:26:41.200" style="s2">would fall for that overnight?</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.360" end="00:26:43.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And now?</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.200" end="00:26:44.960" style="s2">Now you look good. You&#39;ve still got some</p>
<p begin="00:26:43.120" end="00:26:49.159" style="s2">work to do, though. I&#39;ve told you my</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.960" end="00:26:49.159" style="s2">story. Your turn. Full confession.</p>
<p begin="00:26:53.360" end="00:26:57.679" style="s2">I didn&#39;t start wearing the scar because</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.960" end="00:27:00.000" style="s2">I wanted to.</p>
<p begin="00:26:57.679" end="00:27:01.200" style="s2">Something happened years ago and it</p>
<p begin="00:27:00.000" end="00:27:04.159" style="s2">stayed with me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.200" end="00:27:07.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.159" end="00:27:10.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s hard to say. When I was in school,</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.919" end="00:27:12.159" style="s2">someone became obsessed with me. One day</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.559" end="00:27:15.120" style="s2">he and his friends cornered me after</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.159" end="00:27:16.640" style="s2">class. He tried to force himself on me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.120" end="00:27:18.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A woman,</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.640" end="00:27:20.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; a man.</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.240" end="00:27:22.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That was assault. His gender doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.640" end="00:27:25.600" style="s2">change that. I understand why you wanted</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.880" end="00:27:27.360" style="s2">to protect yourself afterwards.</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.600" end="00:27:29.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not angry that I lied.</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.360" end="00:27:30.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You shouldn&#39;t have lied to me, but I</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.200" end="00:27:32.480" style="s2">understand why you felt you needed the</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.480" end="00:27:35.440" style="s2">scar.</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.480" end="00:27:37.279" style="s2">Wait. At the hotel, I saw you with</p>
<p begin="00:27:35.440" end="00:27:40.080" style="s2">Apex&#39;s executive assistant and a whole</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.279" end="00:27:42.640" style="s2">security team.</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.080" end="00:27:44.374" style="s2">You must have seen someone else.</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.640" end="00:27:45.039" style="s2">If I were Apex&#39;s CEO, Victor</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.374" end="00:27:47.039" style="s2">[clears throat] Lawson would have</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.039" end="00:27:49.279" style="s2">recognized me instantly. Lawson Hotels</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.039" end="00:27:51.600" style="s2">works with Apex all the time.</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.279" end="00:27:55.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That makes sense. But he looked exactly</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.600" end="00:27:56.880" style="s2">like you. Let me look up Apex&#39;s CEO.</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.120" end="00:27:59.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to do that. What is there</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.880" end="00:28:02.399" style="s2">to see besides a handsome CEO?</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.600" end="00:28:05.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really? Now you&#39;ve got me curious. Found</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.399" end="00:28:05.399" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.159" end="00:28:11.360" style="s2">There&#39;s no photo, just a name and a bio.</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.960" end="00:28:13.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. I scrubbed every public photo</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.360" end="00:28:15.520" style="s2">before the wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.840" end="00:28:17.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If he hides from cameras, he probably</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.520" end="00:28:18.720" style="s2">likes his privacy. His life has nothing</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.679" end="00:28:20.960" style="s2">to do with ours.</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.720" end="00:28:24.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fair. I&#39;m letting the fake scar go this</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.960" end="00:28:27.480" style="s2">once. But no more lies, Ethan.</p>
<p begin="00:28:24.080" end="00:28:27.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No more lies.</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.600" end="00:28:32.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad can talk his way out of anything.</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.919" end="00:28:34.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if Mara finds her real kids and</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.399" end="00:28:36.559" style="s2">doesn&#39;t want us anymore? We&#39;re not hers.</p>
<p begin="00:28:34.960" end="00:28:38.720" style="s2">Of course, they&#39;d matter more.</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.559" end="00:28:40.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want her to leave.</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.720" end="00:28:46.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s make her feel like we&#39;re a</p>
<p begin="00:28:40.480" end="00:28:46.120" style="s2">real family. Come here. I have a plan.</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.320" end="00:28:52.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, what&#39;s wrong, Lily?</p>
<p begin="00:28:50.480" end="00:28:54.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She wants dad to stay with her tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.399" end="00:28:57.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then dad can stay with you. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:28:54.159" end="00:29:00.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She wants you there, too. Other kids get</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.039" end="00:29:02.960" style="s2">both parents at bedtime. Are Leo and I</p>
<p begin="00:29:00.000" end="00:29:04.799" style="s2">still kids without a mom? No, I&#39;m your</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.960" end="00:29:06.799" style="s2">mom. We even have paperwork.</p>
<p begin="00:29:04.799" end="00:29:09.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But you never sleep next to dad.</p>
<p begin="00:29:06.799" end="00:29:11.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s complicated.</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.520" end="00:29:14.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. Family sleepover. Dad and I will</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.679" end="00:29:16.159" style="s2">both stay.</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.640" end="00:29:19.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.159" end="00:29:19.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Six-pack. Didn&#39;t see that coming.</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.120" end="00:29:20.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You [clears throat] came in for a</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.919" end="00:29:22.960" style="s2">reason.</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.399" end="00:29:23.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily wants both of us there at bedtime.</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.960" end="00:29:26.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Both of us?</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.760" end="00:29:27.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Until they fall asleep, then you can go.</p>
<p begin="00:29:26.080" end="00:29:30.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Six.</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.840" end="00:29:32.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do we get to turn into swans someday?</p>
<p begin="00:29:30.240" end="00:29:34.880" style="s2">We&#39;re people, Lily. That&#39;s not how</p>
<p begin="00:29:32.640" end="00:29:39.880" style="s2">biology works. [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.880" end="00:29:39.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s late, scientists. Time to sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.080" end="00:29:46.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will this work? They&#39;ll get cold, move</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.559" end="00:29:49.039" style="s2">closer, and wake up feeling like a</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.640" end="00:29:53.480" style="s2">family. Then maybe Mara won&#39;t leave.</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.039" end="00:29:53.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s hope it gets really cold.</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.440" end="00:30:00.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan.</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.600" end="00:30:11.760" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry. I woke up with someone</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.919" end="00:30:14.399" style="s2">holding me and my body reacted before my</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.760" end="00:30:16.399" style="s2">brain did.</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.399" end="00:30:18.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can be mad. Just don&#39;t ask me to let</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.399" end="00:30:20.960" style="s2">you kick me back.</p>
<p begin="00:30:18.240" end="00:30:24.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not mad. I&#39;m confused. You launched</p>
<p begin="00:30:20.960" end="00:30:24.279" style="s2">me through drywall.</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.440" end="00:30:31.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was born strong. Very strong.</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.600" end="00:30:34.600" style="s2">That&#39;s funny. Lily says she was born</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.200" end="00:30:34.600" style="s2">strong, too.</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.360" end="00:30:39.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily,</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.120" end="00:30:43.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; why am I so much stronger than everyone</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.279" end="00:30:43.399" style="s2">else? Am I a freak?</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.279" end="00:30:49.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. The women in our family are born</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.840" end="00:30:52.480" style="s2">this way. If you ever have a daughter,</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.840" end="00:30:54.960" style="s2">she may inherit it, too. Lily is</p>
<p begin="00:30:52.480" end="00:30:57.960" style="s2">unusually strong, and Leo and Lily are</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.960" end="00:30:57.960" style="s2">twins.</p>
<p begin="00:31:06.720" end="00:31:13.159" style="s2">Lily, when you say you&#39;re strong, how</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.159" end="00:31:13.159" style="s2">strong?</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.279" end="00:31:22.760" style="s2">This strong. See, super strong.</p>
<p begin="00:31:26.720" end="00:31:32.320" style="s2">That&#39;s what you meant?</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.440" end="00:31:35.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yep.</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.320" end="00:31:39.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could you lift something heavy? A</p>
<p begin="00:31:35.520" end="00:31:39.799" style="s2">boulder about this big?</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.640" end="00:31:47.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, just toys about my size.</p>
<p begin="00:31:45.200" end="00:31:49.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What were you thinking?</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.440" end="00:31:52.159" style="s2">There&#39;s no way these two are your</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.039" end="00:31:55.600" style="s2">missing twins.</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.159" end="00:31:58.159" style="s2">Are you sad?</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.600" end="00:32:00.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. I still need to finish patching up</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.159" end="00:32:02.080" style="s2">your dad. You two play and I&#39;ll make</p>
<p begin="00:32:00.399" end="00:32:04.480" style="s2">grilled cheese after.</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.080" end="00:32:07.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.480" end="00:32:11.320" style="s2">You almost gave us away. Why can&#39;t we</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.120" end="00:32:11.320" style="s2">tell her I can lift a real boulder?</p>
<p begin="00:32:12.960" end="00:32:16.880" style="s2">Remember the last woman Dad introduced</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.880" end="00:32:18.640" style="s2">us to?</p>
<p begin="00:32:16.880" end="00:32:20.320" style="s2">She saw your strength and called you a</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.640" end="00:32:23.519" style="s2">monster.</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.320" end="00:32:26.919" style="s2">What if Mara gets scared too? Then we</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.519" end="00:32:26.919" style="s2">keep it secret.</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.799" end="00:32:36.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.360" end="00:32:36.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:32:37.200" end="00:32:42.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let me give you some good news.</p>
<p begin="00:32:40.720" end="00:32:45.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What news?</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.159" end="00:32:45.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come with me.</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.640" end="00:32:54.640" style="s2">You said we needed more room. What do</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.720" end="00:32:56.640" style="s2">you think?</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.640" end="00:32:59.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s beautiful</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.640" end="00:33:00.720" style="s2">and way out of our budget. Your paycheck</p>
<p begin="00:32:59.039" end="00:33:04.080" style="s2">can&#39;t cover this place.</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.720" end="00:33:05.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We don&#39;t pay rent.</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.080" end="00:33:07.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:33:05.279" end="00:33:09.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My boss owns it as an investment. It was</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.679" end="00:33:14.200" style="s2">sitting empty, so he offered it with one</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.440" end="00:33:14.200" style="s2">condition. We keep it in good shape.</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.320" end="00:33:18.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seriously?</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.919" end="00:33:18.919" style="s2">Seriously,</p>
<p begin="00:33:22.357" end="00:33:26.120" style="s2">[bell]</p>
<p begin="00:33:22.640" end="00:33:26.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; this is amazing.</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.559" end="00:33:35.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We want hugs, too. Me, too.</p>
