<p begin="00:33:43.318" end="00:33:45.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:33:47.360" end="00:33:51.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everybody gets a hug. All right, team.</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.679" end="00:33:54.840" style="s2">Let&#39;s clean.</p>
<p begin="00:33:51.360" end="00:33:54.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about me?</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.519" end="00:34:00.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can carry the trash carefully.</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.919" end="00:34:16.320" style="s2">Dad, please don&#39;t hurt Mara. She</p>
