<p begin="00:34:16.320" end="00:34:20.280" style="s2">event, but she&#39;s still my sister.</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.200" end="00:34:25.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t touch her.</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.679" end="00:34:28.240" style="s2">Her husband boxed me in with my own</p>
