<p begin="00:34:30.879" end="00:34:34.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did you fall for that?</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.839" end="00:34:39.760" style="s2">You wanted an easy job with a big title.</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.000" end="00:34:42.560" style="s2">I got you design director at Summit</p>
