<p begin="00:34:42.560" end="00:34:46.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Brandon.</p>
<p begin="00:34:49.473" end="00:34:52.240" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:34:49.919" end="00:34:53.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m done. Time for work.</p>
<p begin="00:34:52.240" end="00:34:56.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looking like that.</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.280" end="00:34:59.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I drive. It&#39;s not exactly heavy lifting.</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.000" end="00:35:02.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Stay home and heal. Kids, I&#39;m taking</p>
