<p begin="00:35:20.800" end="00:35:24.960" style="s2">father, stepmother, and sister.</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.280" end="00:35:27.040" style="s2">Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.960" end="00:35:28.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your husband is sharp. He got your dad</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.040" end="00:35:30.800" style="s2">to expose himself, then used the</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.480" end="00:35:33.680" style="s2">doorbell video to stop the whole thing.</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.800" end="00:35:35.760" style="s2">He&#39;s not that impressive. Strategic,</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.680" end="00:35:38.960" style="s2">handsome, and broke. Two out of three</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.760" end="00:35:40.400" style="s2">isn&#39;t bad.</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.960" end="00:35:43.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Speaking of money, can you help me find</p>
