<p begin="00:37:03.760" end="00:37:08.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Parents want their kids to have choices.</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.920" end="00:37:11.119" style="s2">If they call me mom, I show up like one.</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.800" end="00:37:14.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But they&#39;re not biologically yours.</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.119" end="00:37:16.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That doesn&#39;t make them less mine.</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.640" end="00:37:18.079" style="s2">Why? You sound like you don&#39;t want me</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.240" end="00:37:19.280" style="s2">investing in them. Are you planning to</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.079" end="00:37:24.200" style="s2">divorce me?</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.280" end="00:37:24.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. I was going to tell you something.</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.160" end="00:37:29.040" style="s2">Tell me if Liam is a liar.</p>
