<p begin="00:37:42.880" end="00:37:47.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is being rich the crime? [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.200" end="00:37:50.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The money isn&#39;t the problem.</p>
<p begin="00:37:47.839" end="00:37:52.079" style="s2">I loved him, not his account. The</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.320" end="00:37:53.839" style="s2">problem is that he made me fall for a</p>
<p begin="00:37:52.079" end="00:37:57.200" style="s2">person he invented.</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.839" end="00:37:59.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m ending it.</p>
