<p begin="00:38:09.920" end="00:38:15.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fear explains it. It doesn&#39;t erase it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.440" end="00:38:17.920" style="s2">One lie that controls my choices is</p>
