<p begin="00:39:54.560" end="00:40:00.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since when is Sabrina married to a Cole?</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.480" end="00:40:02.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your desk is here.</p>
<p begin="00:40:00.800" end="00:40:04.480" style="s2">Thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:40:02.720" end="00:40:06.480" style="s2">A handsome husband is useless without</p>
