<p begin="00:42:25.920" end="00:42:29.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You two can keep fantasizing. I own a</p>
<p begin="00:42:27.839" end="00:42:33.040" style="s2">mansion, too. Everyone is invited</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.760" end="00:42:34.640" style="s2">tonight. A mansion in Newport Coast</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.040" end="00:42:36.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; with her husband. It has to be eight</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.640" end="00:42:40.720" style="s2">figures.</p>
<p begin="00:42:36.640" end="00:42:43.359" style="s2">Cars, ocean views. Must be nice.</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.720" end="00:42:45.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I married Well, Mara, you could still</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.359" end="00:42:46.880" style="s2">trade in the driver. I can introduce you</p>
<p begin="00:42:45.440" end="00:42:49.520" style="s2">to someone with money.</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.880" end="00:42:51.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t call my dad worthless.</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.520" end="00:42:53.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry, but a man with no home of his own</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.760" end="00:42:54.240" style="s2">isn&#39;t exactly impressive.</p>
<p begin="00:42:53.119" end="00:42:56.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad has a mansion.</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.240" end="00:42:58.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.160" end="00:43:00.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then invite us there first. Everyone can</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.400" end="00:43:00.960" style="s2">see yours tonight and [music] mine this</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.079" end="00:43:05.520" style="s2">weekend.</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.960" end="00:43:07.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara, you&#39;re secretly rich. Can we come?</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.520" end="00:43:08.800" style="s2">I</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.359" end="00:43:10.000" style="s2">unless you think your co-workers will</p>
<p begin="00:43:08.800" end="00:43:11.839" style="s2">dirty the place.</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.000" end="00:43:12.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She doesn&#39;t think that. Stop twisting</p>
<p begin="00:43:11.839" end="00:43:13.359" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:43:12.240" end="00:43:17.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why say no?</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.359" end="00:43:19.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She didn&#39;t say no.</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.040" end="00:43:19.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m doomed. Where am I supposed to find</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.040" end="00:43:23.200" style="s2">a mansion?</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.920" end="00:43:25.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad has one.</p>
<p begin="00:43:23.200" end="00:43:28.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Remember? It belongs to my boss. I took</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.440" end="00:43:29.760" style="s2">you there while Mara was out.</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.160" end="00:43:32.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Would guests bother him?</p>
<p begin="00:43:29.760" end="00:43:34.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one is staying there right now.</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.480" end="00:43:35.920" style="s2">What if we only stop outside? Then I</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.560" end="00:43:37.680" style="s2">pretend I forgot the key and take</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.920" end="00:43:38.480" style="s2">everyone home.</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.680" end="00:43:40.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brilliant.</p>
<p begin="00:43:38.480" end="00:43:43.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ask your boss first.</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.079" end="00:43:45.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave it to me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.520" end="00:43:47.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He said yes.</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.920" end="00:43:50.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You saved me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:47.680" end="00:43:52.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sabrina insulted Mara and Dad. Tonight</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.160" end="00:43:55.520" style="s2">she learns not to judge people by money.</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.880" end="00:43:57.040" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:43:55.520" end="00:43:59.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa. Grandma.</p>
<p begin="00:43:57.040" end="00:44:00.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I haven&#39;t seen you in months. I miss you</p>
<p begin="00:43:59.200" end="00:44:02.319" style="s2">both.</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.640" end="00:44:05.200" style="s2">Where&#39;s your father, Lily?</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.319" end="00:44:07.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He went out with mom.</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.200" end="00:44:10.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom?</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.760" end="00:44:11.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He got married and never told us. I</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.240" end="00:44:13.680" style="s2">almost introduced him to the Witmore</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.680" end="00:44:15.200" style="s2">family. Leo, tell your father to bring</p>
<p begin="00:44:13.680" end="00:44:17.599" style="s2">his wife to us.</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.200" end="00:44:20.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll fly out. I want Mara to feel</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.599" end="00:44:22.400" style="s2">welcome. I&#39;ll bring the family emerald</p>
<p begin="00:44:20.000" end="00:44:24.800" style="s2">bracelet and the Laguna condo papers in</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.400" end="00:44:25.839" style="s2">case she&#39;d like a place of her own. Is</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.800" end="00:44:27.520" style="s2">that too much?</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.839" end="00:44:30.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We haven&#39;t met her. Maybe start with</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.520" end="00:44:33.119" style="s2">hello. I know Ethan kept this marriage</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.880" end="00:44:35.119" style="s2">from us. What else has he kept from her?</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.119" end="00:44:37.040" style="s2">Most of my cash is tied up in that clean</p>
<p begin="00:44:35.119" end="00:44:38.480" style="s2">energy investment. I can at least show</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.040" end="00:44:40.640" style="s2">her what I already own.</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.480" end="00:44:41.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She needs us to listen, not hand her an</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.640" end="00:44:42.880" style="s2">inventory.</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.440" end="00:44:44.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if she thinks we&#39;re trying to buy</p>
<p begin="00:44:42.880" end="00:44:46.400" style="s2">her affection?</p>
<p begin="00:44:44.560" end="00:44:46.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we put the papers away and get to</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.400" end="00:44:50.560" style="s2">know her.</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.880" end="00:44:52.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, we listen first. This is it.</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.560" end="00:44:55.200" style="s2">Let me get the door.</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.880" end="00:44:56.720" style="s2">I forgot the key. Did you bring yours?</p>
<p begin="00:44:55.200" end="00:44:58.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Apparently not.</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.720" end="00:45:02.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry. We&#39;ll have to do this another</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.640" end="00:45:04.880" style="s2">time. Forgot the key. This isn&#39;t your</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.160" end="00:45:10.000" style="s2">house. Sabrina, let it go. We can come</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.880" end="00:45:13.640" style="s2">another time. Absolutely. Next time.</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.000" end="00:45:13.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, you&#39;re home.</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.960" end="00:45:17.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This living room is bigger than my</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.800" end="00:45:18.319" style="s2">apartment.</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.599" end="00:45:20.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That [clears throat] looks like an</p>
<p begin="00:45:18.319" end="00:45:22.000" style="s2">authenticated bescua. It could be worth</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.640" end="00:45:24.240" style="s2">millions.</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.000" end="00:45:26.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sabrina looked rich. Mara, you&#39;re the</p>
<p begin="00:45:24.240" end="00:45:27.680" style="s2">real surprise.</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.160" end="00:45:30.560" style="s2">Why are you here?</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.680" end="00:45:32.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad brought us before. We have a key.</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.560" end="00:45:33.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch anything. We could never</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.160" end="00:45:35.440" style="s2">replace it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.280" end="00:45:38.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.440" end="00:45:40.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her husband is a $60,000 driver. This</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.400" end="00:45:42.160" style="s2">place has to be rented for the night.</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.800" end="00:45:44.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Show me the rental listing.</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.160" end="00:45:45.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then open the wine. If it&#39;s really</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.079" end="00:45:47.119" style="s2">yours, you won&#39;t mind.</p>
<p begin="00:45:45.359" end="00:45:49.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those are rare Burgundis. Some bottles</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.119" end="00:45:53.119" style="s2">run $10,000.</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.680" end="00:45:55.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10,000 a bottle? Can we try one? Maybe,</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.119" end="00:45:58.280" style="s2">but I don&#39;t see a corkcrew. Leo, could</p>
<p begin="00:45:55.119" end="00:45:58.280" style="s2">you look?</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.560" end="00:46:02.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Found it.</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.359" end="00:46:04.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s incredibly generous. Thank</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.821" end="00:46:07.119" style="s2">[music] you, Mara.</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.079" end="00:46:08.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m finished.</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.119" end="00:46:11.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, those aren&#39;t the rare</p>
<p begin="00:46:08.960" end="00:46:12.640" style="s2">bottles.</p>
<p begin="00:46:11.119" end="00:46:15.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They are not.</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.640" end="00:46:17.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo had the staff lock the valuable wine</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.440" end="00:46:21.000" style="s2">in the cellar. These came from the</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.599" end="00:46:21.000" style="s2">grocery store.</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.472" end="00:46:27.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.160" end="00:46:27.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You two are lifesavers.</p>
<p begin="00:46:27.839" end="00:46:32.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone enjoy. It&#39;s table wine, not a</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.720" end="00:46:35.680" style="s2">museum piece.</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.720" end="00:46:37.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.680" end="00:46:39.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A few bottles and suddenly everyone is</p>
<p begin="00:46:37.440" end="00:46:41.200" style="s2">impressed. Small town [music] tastes.</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.760" end="00:46:42.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then bring something better this</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.200" end="00:46:45.400" style="s2">weekend.</p>
<p begin="00:46:42.400" end="00:46:45.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.000" end="00:46:50.560" style="s2">Mom, [music] you and dad are already</p>
<p begin="00:46:47.839" end="00:46:52.720" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:46:50.560" end="00:46:55.280" style="s2">My parents are back</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.720" end="00:46:56.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; tonight. I didn&#39;t change or bring a</p>
<p begin="00:46:55.280" end="00:46:58.079" style="s2">gift.</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.240" end="00:46:59.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll take the kids to meet them. Stay</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.079" end="00:47:02.760" style="s2">with your co-workers. You can meet</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.760" end="00:47:02.760" style="s2">tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.440" end="00:47:08.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan said he&#39;d pick us up. Why did you</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.839" end="00:47:11.599" style="s2">come here?</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.319" end="00:47:13.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The papers for this house are here, too.</p>
<p begin="00:47:11.599" end="00:47:16.319" style="s2">If Mara wants a place of her own, we can</p>
<p begin="00:47:13.680" end="00:47:19.319" style="s2">offer it. Let&#39;s hear what she wants</p>
<p begin="00:47:16.319" end="00:47:19.319" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.200" end="00:47:30.040" style="s2">Who are you and why are you in my house?</p>
<p begin="00:47:31.680" end="00:47:36.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.480" end="00:47:39.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I left the car key inside. We have to go</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.720" end="00:47:39.720" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.960" end="00:47:46.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your house.</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.920" end="00:47:53.920" style="s2">Yes, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.599" end="00:47:55.760" style="s2">my name is on the deed. Mara, dad taught</p>
<p begin="00:47:53.920" end="00:47:56.960" style="s2">us to be honest. You passed off someone</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.760" end="00:47:58.880" style="s2">else&#39;s home as yours.</p>
<p begin="00:47:56.960" end="00:48:01.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, it isn&#39;t Mara&#39;s. And the wine isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:47:58.880" end="00:48:02.880" style="s2">hers either. The bottles out here are</p>
<p begin="00:48:01.040" end="00:48:03.680" style="s2">ordinary. The rare wine is locked</p>
<p begin="00:48:02.880" end="00:48:05.440" style="s2">downstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.680" end="00:48:07.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good, because none of us agreed to drink</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.440" end="00:48:10.240" style="s2">five figure wine. Mara, you put everyone</p>
<p begin="00:48:07.680" end="00:48:12.319" style="s2">in a terrible position.</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.240" end="00:48:16.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now, the real owner is here. Let&#39;s see</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.319" end="00:48:16.119" style="s2">how you escape this.</p>
<p begin="00:48:16.560" end="00:48:20.960" style="s2">You&#39;re right. I said something untrue</p>
<p begin="00:48:19.119" end="00:48:23.280" style="s2">because I was cornered, but that was</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.960" end="00:48:27.040" style="s2">still my choice.</p>
<p begin="00:48:23.280" end="00:48:29.119" style="s2">Please total any loss. I&#39;ll repay it.</p>
<p begin="00:48:27.040" end="00:48:30.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She takes responsibility.</p>
<p begin="00:48:29.119" end="00:48:32.640" style="s2">I like her.</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.559" end="00:48:36.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In that case,</p>
<p begin="00:48:32.640" end="00:48:36.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa. Grandma.</p>
<p begin="00:48:38.400" end="00:48:45.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma. Grandpa.</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.359" end="00:48:45.240" style="s2">Ethan, they&#39;re your parents.</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.359" end="00:48:50.480" style="s2">Yes. They don&#39;t know I&#39;m hiding my</p>
<p begin="00:48:47.680" end="00:48:53.960" style="s2">identity. This is a disaster.</p>
<p begin="00:48:50.480" end="00:48:53.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re my daughter-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:48:54.079" end="00:48:59.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.920" end="00:49:02.319" style="s2">She called me mom. Richard, I finally</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.200" end="00:49:04.319" style="s2">have a daughter-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.319" end="00:49:06.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She was convinced I&#39;d never marry. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:49:04.319" end="00:49:09.280" style="s2">overwhelmed.</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.960" end="00:49:10.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand. Mom, sit down. I&#39;ll get</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.280" end="00:49:12.240" style="s2">you water.</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.079" end="00:49:15.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Water can wait. Richard, bring me my</p>
<p begin="00:49:12.240" end="00:49:15.559" style="s2">mother&#39;s bracelet.</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.240" end="00:49:20.319" style="s2">This emerald bracelet was Ethan&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.839" end="00:49:22.160" style="s2">grandmother&#39;s. I&#39;d like you to have it.</p>
<p begin="00:49:20.319" end="00:49:24.640" style="s2">The Laguna condo and this house are in</p>
<p begin="00:49:22.160" end="00:49:26.800" style="s2">my name, too. If having a place of your</p>
<p begin="00:49:24.640" end="00:49:30.599" style="s2">own would help, [music] we can talk. You</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.800" end="00:49:30.599" style="s2">don&#39;t have to decide tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.920" end="00:49:36.880" style="s2">Why did your mother give me a bracelet</p>
<p begin="00:49:35.280" end="00:49:39.200" style="s2">and offer me property?</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.880" end="00:49:41.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The bracelet is hers. The properties are</p>
<p begin="00:49:39.200" end="00:49:43.200" style="s2">offers, not transfers. Mom wanted you to</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.599" end="00:49:44.160" style="s2">feel welcome. I should have asked her to</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.200" end="00:49:46.240" style="s2">slow down.</p>
<p begin="00:49:44.160" end="00:49:48.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She even showed me the deeds.</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.240" end="00:49:49.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. She overstepped. I&#39;ll talk to</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.640" end="00:49:51.760" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:49:49.760" end="00:49:55.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care if you&#39;re poor. We can</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.760" end="00:49:55.240" style="s2">build a life ourselves.</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.359" end="00:49:58.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do we tell my parents?</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.800" end="00:50:00.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can accept the bracelet tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:49:58.624" end="00:50:02.000" style="s2">[music] I won&#39;t accept property. At</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.480" end="00:50:05.000" style="s2">least not until I understand what it</p>
<p begin="00:50:02.000" end="00:50:05.000" style="s2">means.</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.440" end="00:50:12.079" style="s2">Thank you, Mom. She took the bracelet</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.760" end="00:50:13.280" style="s2">and she still wants to talk to us. Try</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.079" end="00:50:16.280" style="s2">on the bracelet.</p>
<p begin="00:50:13.280" end="00:50:16.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.520" end="00:50:24.240" style="s2">It belongs on you.</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.800" end="00:50:26.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It looks fake.</p>
<p begin="00:50:24.240" end="00:50:27.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It isn&#39;t. I saw that piece at a charity</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.480" end="00:50:28.400" style="s2">auction preview.</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.359" end="00:50:32.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where do you work, Mara?</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.400" end="00:50:35.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m a junior designer at Summit.</p>
<p begin="00:50:32.400" end="00:50:38.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good field. plenty of room to grow.</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.599" end="00:50:40.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s probationary. With me as director,</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.160" end="00:50:42.880" style="s2">she won&#39;t make it past 90 days.</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.000" end="00:50:46.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s retaliation. Dad, are you going</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.880" end="00:50:48.079" style="s2">to protect her? Call your boss.</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.240" end="00:50:49.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good idea.</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.079" end="00:50:51.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Cole, I&#39;d like to report that</p>
<p begin="00:50:49.760" end="00:50:53.119" style="s2">Summit&#39;s design director threatened a</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.280" end="00:50:54.559" style="s2">probationary employee in public. We&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:50:53.119" end="00:50:58.680" style="s2">preserve the witness statements and send</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.559" end="00:50:58.680" style="s2">it to HR and compliance. Now,</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.920" end="00:51:06.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; what do you mean? I&#39;m suspended pending</p>
<p begin="00:51:03.599" end="00:51:06.599" style="s2">review.</p>
<p begin="00:51:07.040" end="00:51:11.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How can they suspend me?</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.800" end="00:51:14.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You threatened an employee. HR has</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.280" end="00:51:17.119" style="s2">witnesses.</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.240" end="00:51:18.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s one job. Brandon can buy me another</p>
<p begin="00:51:17.119" end="00:51:21.280" style="s2">title. That&#39;s not the defense you think</p>
<p begin="00:51:18.960" end="00:51:24.640" style="s2">it is.</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.280" end="00:51:26.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A vintage Maserati spider. Expensive.</p>
<p begin="00:51:24.640" end="00:51:29.240" style="s2">And Shaw Development can&#39;t afford it</p>
<p begin="00:51:26.240" end="00:51:29.240" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.520" end="00:51:35.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you saying? Their lenders froze</p>
<p begin="00:51:31.440" end="00:51:35.960" style="s2">new credit after an audit. Call him.</p>
<p begin="00:51:38.160" end="00:51:41.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brandon, are you in trouble?</p>
<p begin="00:51:39.839" end="00:51:44.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have a liquidity problem. Can you</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.599" end="00:51:44.920" style="s2">lend me anything?</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.520" end="00:51:53.079" style="s2">This isn&#39;t over.</p>
<p begin="00:51:55.040" end="00:52:00.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did you know about Shaw&#39;s credit?</p>
<p begin="00:51:57.839" end="00:52:01.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My boss mentioned the audit. He cut</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.160" end="00:52:04.760" style="s2">business with Brendan after what</p>
<p begin="00:52:01.440" end="00:52:04.760" style="s2">happened to you.</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.000" end="00:52:11.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good actions finally have consequences.</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.800" end="00:52:18.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have better news coming.</p>
<p begin="00:52:16.480" end="00:52:21.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:52:18.559" end="00:52:21.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Soon.</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.119" end="00:52:26.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did Mara do this to you again?</p>
<p begin="00:52:24.960" end="00:52:30.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She reported me because she was jealous</p>
<p begin="00:52:26.640" end="00:52:30.040" style="s2">of my job.</p>
<p begin="00:52:31.359" end="00:52:35.000" style="s2">I&#39;ll confront her.</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.119" end="00:52:50.720" style="s2">Ethan, this is a misunderstanding. Your</p>
<p begin="00:52:47.839" end="00:52:52.720" style="s2">family, sit down. This is a recorded</p>
<p begin="00:52:50.720" end="00:52:54.160" style="s2">voluntary interview. Your attorney is</p>
<p begin="00:52:52.720" end="00:52:55.920" style="s2">present. You may leave, but the</p>
<p begin="00:52:54.160" end="00:52:57.839" style="s2">preservation notice remains. You have</p>
<p begin="00:52:55.920" end="00:52:59.760" style="s2">repeatedly harassed my wife. That stops</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.839" end="00:53:01.920" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="00:52:59.760" end="00:53:03.920" style="s2">First, apologize.</p>
<p begin="00:53:01.920" end="00:53:05.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:53:03.920" end="00:53:10.000" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:53:05.440" end="00:53:12.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry. Now, the missing twins.</p>
<p begin="00:53:10.000" end="00:53:14.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vanessa, did you transfer Mara&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:53:12.240" end="00:53:17.480" style="s2">newborns?</p>
<p begin="00:53:14.480" end="00:53:17.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:53:18.160" end="00:53:23.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are they?</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.760" end="00:53:25.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know where they are now.</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.200" end="00:53:28.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then tell us what you do know.</p>
<p begin="00:53:25.599" end="00:53:30.160" style="s2">A woman paid me $100,000 to hand over</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.160" end="00:53:31.599" style="s2">the babies. I followed her afterwards</p>
<p begin="00:53:30.160" end="00:53:32.720" style="s2">and found her address.</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.599" end="00:53:37.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where?</p>
<p begin="00:53:32.720" end="00:53:40.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 701 1180 Harbor Street, Long Beach.</p>
<p begin="00:53:37.839" end="00:53:43.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Name?</p>
<p begin="00:53:40.800" end="00:53:45.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Linda Mercul.</p>
<p begin="00:53:43.280" end="00:53:46.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Any further contact with Mara goes</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.040" end="00:53:48.400" style="s2">through counsel. If you harass her</p>
<p begin="00:53:46.960" end="00:53:52.520" style="s2">again, we&#39;ll seek a restraining order</p>
<p begin="00:53:48.400" end="00:53:52.520" style="s2">and every lawful remedy available.</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.040" end="00:54:00.119" style="s2">Stay home. I have good news.</p>
<p begin="00:54:05.599" end="00:54:10.680" style="s2">Mara, I found a lead to your twins.</p>
<p begin="00:54:14.480" end="00:54:18.240" style="s2">After all these years, what if they</p>
<p begin="00:54:15.920" end="00:54:20.079" style="s2">don&#39;t want me?</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.240" end="00:54:24.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t abandon them. They were</p>
<p begin="00:54:20.079" end="00:54:24.359" style="s2">taken. The truth matters.</p>
<p begin="00:54:24.400" end="00:54:29.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you looking for? Linda Mercer.</p>
<p begin="00:54:26.720" end="00:54:33.119" style="s2">Does she live here? She moved 5 years</p>
<p begin="00:54:29.599" end="00:54:35.359" style="s2">ago. Do you know where? No, she sold the</p>
<p begin="00:54:33.119" end="00:54:39.480" style="s2">unit and disappeared.</p>
<p begin="00:54:35.359" end="00:54:39.480" style="s2">Please call if you remember anything.</p>
<p begin="00:54:44.640" end="00:54:47.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Cole, the twin&#39;s birthother found</p>
<p begin="00:54:46.960" end="00:54:49.760" style="s2">the old address.</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.839" end="00:54:52.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, she finally traced it. Should</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.760" end="00:54:54.640" style="s2">security intervene?</p>
<p begin="00:54:52.160" end="00:54:56.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. I took the babies because I decided</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.640" end="00:54:58.000" style="s2">she wasn&#39;t good enough for Ethan. 5</p>
<p begin="00:54:56.559" end="00:54:59.520" style="s2">years later, he still never chose</p>
<p begin="00:54:58.000" end="00:55:01.920" style="s2">anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:54:59.520" end="00:55:04.920" style="s2">Arrange a meeting and bring Ethan here</p>
<p begin="00:55:01.920" end="00:55:04.920" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.599" end="00:55:11.079" style="s2">We&#39;ll keep looking.</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.520" end="00:55:18.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Find the child&#39;s biological mother.</p>
<p begin="00:55:14.720" end="00:55:18.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You found Leo and Lily&#39;s birthother.</p>
<p begin="00:55:19.119" end="00:55:22.119" style="s2">Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.240" end="00:55:26.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara, I have to handle something.</p>
<p begin="00:55:24.880" end="00:55:27.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll get home myself.</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.400" end="00:55:30.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll call a car.</p>
<p begin="00:55:27.599" end="00:55:32.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, go.</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.240" end="00:55:36.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Their real mother is back. Maybe my</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.720" end="00:55:36.680" style="s2">borrowed family just expired.</p>
<p begin="00:55:42.480" end="00:55:46.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You look sad.</p>
<p begin="00:55:43.680" end="00:55:49.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have good news. Your birth mother was</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.319" end="00:55:51.520" style="s2">found. But you&#39;re our mom.</p>
<p begin="00:55:49.200" end="00:55:52.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s scared we&#39;ll leave. We won&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:55:51.520" end="00:55:55.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if dad leaves?</p>
<p begin="00:55:52.960" end="00:55:58.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then he can explain himself. You don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:55:55.200" end="00:55:58.839" style="s2">lose us with him.</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.280" end="00:56:05.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will find you.</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.440" end="00:56:09.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You remembered something. I&#39;m coming</p>
<p begin="00:56:06.880" end="00:56:09.880" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:56:13.280" end="00:56:16.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re Linda Mercer.</p>
<p begin="00:56:15.280" end="00:56:18.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:56:16.640" end="00:56:21.559" style="s2">Vanessa sold me access to your newborn</p>
<p begin="00:56:18.559" end="00:56:21.559" style="s2">twins.</p>
<p begin="00:56:21.920" end="00:56:28.520" style="s2">I delivered them to the woman who paid</p>
<p begin="00:56:23.599" end="00:56:28.520" style="s2">her. Where are my children?</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.839" end="00:56:37.280" style="s2">Meet their father there. He has the rest</p>
<p begin="00:56:34.240" end="00:56:39.760" style="s2">of the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.280" end="00:56:42.240" style="s2">You were drugged that night. Mara was</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.760" end="00:56:44.319" style="s2">also unable to consent.</p>
<p begin="00:56:42.240" end="00:56:46.319" style="s2">When she gave birth, I paid Vanessa to</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.319" end="00:56:47.119" style="s2">take the twins because I judged Mara by</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.319" end="00:56:48.480" style="s2">her class.</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.119" end="00:56:51.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You separated a mother from her</p>
<p begin="00:56:48.480" end="00:56:53.839" style="s2">children. Why tell me now?</p>
<p begin="00:56:51.520" end="00:56:55.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meet her. She deserves the truth and the</p>
<p begin="00:56:53.839" end="00:56:56.799" style="s2">children deserve a choice.</p>
<p begin="00:56:55.040" end="00:56:59.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will and then we discuss</p>
<p begin="00:56:56.799" end="00:56:59.799" style="s2">accountability.</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.689" end="00:57:07.709" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:57:24.720" end="00:57:27.920" style="s2">Mara,</p>
<p begin="00:57:26.319" end="00:57:30.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; are you here to meet Leo and Lily&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:57:27.920" end="00:57:32.880" style="s2">birthother?</p>
<p begin="00:57:30.160" end="00:57:35.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only to learn the truth. Nothing changes</p>
<p begin="00:57:32.880" end="00:57:37.280" style="s2">what I feel about you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.440" end="00:57:38.960" style="s2">You don&#39;t need [music] to promise. I</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.280" end="00:57:40.960" style="s2">trust you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:38.960" end="00:57:43.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you here?</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.960" end="00:57:45.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To meet my twin&#39;s father.</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.760" end="00:57:48.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The man from that night.</p>
<p begin="00:57:45.680" end="00:57:48.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:57:54.720" end="00:57:58.040" style="s2">So yes,</p>
<p begin="00:58:03.680" end="00:58:08.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara. I thought Ethan brought you</p>
<p begin="00:58:05.920" end="00:58:11.119" style="s2">somewhere expensive.</p>
<p begin="00:58:08.079" end="00:58:13.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It isn&#39;t Ethan. Then who? [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.119" end="00:58:16.079" style="s2">My twin&#39;s father.</p>
<p begin="00:58:13.599" end="00:58:20.280" style="s2">What happens if he wants a family? You</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.079" end="00:58:20.280" style="s2">already have Ethan and the kids.</p>
<p begin="00:58:20.960" end="00:58:25.839" style="s2">I don&#39;t know. I won&#39;t abandon any of the</p>
<p begin="00:58:23.440" end="00:58:28.000" style="s2">children.</p>
<p begin="00:58:25.839" end="00:58:31.550" style="s2">First, I need facts. Then, we decide</p>
<p begin="00:58:28.000" end="00:58:31.550" style="s2">what&#39;s safe and right for them. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.599" end="00:58:41.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Imagine if Ethan is the father and Leo</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.799" end="00:58:45.280" style="s2">and Lily are your twins. One impossible</p>
<p begin="00:58:41.760" end="00:58:48.240" style="s2">answer fixes everything.</p>
<p begin="00:58:45.280" end="00:58:52.440" style="s2">Even a soap opera would reject that.</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.240" end="00:58:52.440" style="s2">I&#39;m staying until you feel safe.</p>
<p begin="00:58:53.765" end="00:58:55.785" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.640" end="00:59:05.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara,</p>
<p begin="00:59:13.040" end="00:59:17.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know where the children are.</p>
<p begin="00:59:17.839" end="00:59:25.400" style="s2">You get access only if you marry me.</p>
<p begin="00:59:20.720" end="00:59:25.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is coercion, not a proposal.</p>
<p begin="00:59:27.040" end="00:59:30.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.040" end="00:59:41.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You finally know who I am.</p>
<p begin="00:59:41.440" end="00:59:46.280" style="s2">I am Leo and Lily&#39;s mother.</p>
<p begin="00:59:47.440" end="00:59:52.839" style="s2">You claim you are their mother. Prove</p>
<p begin="00:59:49.839" end="00:59:52.839" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:59:53.839" end="01:00:00.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Dayton Hotel match.</p>
<p begin="00:59:56.799" end="01:00:04.559" style="s2">You left this engraved watch behind.</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.720" end="01:00:08.119" style="s2">I carried them, suffered for them, and</p>
<p begin="01:00:04.559" end="01:00:08.119" style="s2">only want visits.</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.480" end="01:00:15.119" style="s2">No contact until an accredited DNA test</p>
<p begin="01:00:12.160" end="01:00:18.000" style="s2">and a child safety review.</p>
<p begin="01:00:15.119" end="01:00:21.000" style="s2">Do not approach them or expose private</p>
<p begin="01:00:18.000" end="01:00:21.000" style="s2">information.</p>
<p begin="01:00:38.567" end="01:00:40.587" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:00:41.920" end="01:00:45.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara, don&#39;t rush into another marriage</p>
<p begin="01:00:43.839" end="01:00:48.880" style="s2">just because you&#39;re desperate to find</p>
<p begin="01:00:45.119" end="01:00:51.200" style="s2">your child. Don&#39;t worry, I won&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.880" end="01:00:54.440" style="s2">Wait, isn&#39;t that Sabrina sitting across</p>
<p begin="01:00:51.200" end="01:00:54.440" style="s2">from Ethan?</p>
<p begin="01:00:55.280" end="01:00:59.359" style="s2">So, Sabrina claims she is their mother.</p>
<p begin="01:00:57.520" end="01:01:01.599" style="s2">I only want to visit them. Not without</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.359" end="01:01:04.880" style="s2">verified DNA, counsel, and a safety</p>
<p begin="01:01:01.599" end="01:01:06.720" style="s2">plan. Leave my home now. Kids, pack for</p>
<p begin="01:01:04.880" end="01:01:09.040" style="s2">school. No one is hitting anyone. Ethan</p>
<p begin="01:01:06.720" end="01:01:10.400" style="s2">and I need an honest conversation.</p>
<p begin="01:01:09.040" end="01:01:13.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I should have told you before she came</p>
<p begin="01:01:10.400" end="01:01:13.960" style="s2">here. I am sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:01:15.680" end="01:01:18.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop with the puppy eyes. If Sabrina is</p>
<p begin="01:01:17.520" end="01:01:19.119" style="s2">their mother, when do you plan to</p>
<p begin="01:01:18.480" end="01:01:20.960" style="s2">divorce me?</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.119" end="01:01:22.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t. You are my wife and no one</p>
<p begin="01:01:20.960" end="01:01:26.119" style="s2">unverified a claim can change that.</p>
<p begin="01:01:22.480" end="01:01:26.119" style="s2">Kids, tell her.</p>
<p begin="01:01:28.640" end="01:01:31.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is your mom? [music]</p>
<p begin="01:01:29.760" end="01:01:33.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara.</p>
<p begin="01:01:31.680" end="01:01:36.680" style="s2">We are a family because we keep choosing</p>
<p begin="01:01:33.440" end="01:01:36.680" style="s2">one another.</p>
<p begin="01:01:37.599" end="01:01:41.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $8,000. Where did you get this?</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.680" end="01:01:43.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My boss&#39;s company had a sample sale. It</p>
<p begin="01:01:41.599" end="01:01:44.240" style="s2">can&#39;t be resold, so I got it almost</p>
<p begin="01:01:43.119" end="01:01:49.160" style="s2">free.</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.240" end="01:01:49.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It looks real. Thank you, my husband.</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.307" end="01:01:51.327" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.079" end="01:01:55.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan believes I might be the twin&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:01:53.760" end="01:01:57.280" style="s2">mother. Our future depends on you</p>
<p begin="01:01:55.680" end="01:01:59.680" style="s2">getting into that family. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:01:57.280" end="01:02:02.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I took Brandon from Mara. I can take</p>
<p begin="01:01:59.680" end="01:02:02.720" style="s2">Ethan, too.</p>
<p begin="01:02:03.280" end="01:02:07.040" style="s2">We drugged Mara and she ended up with</p>
<p begin="01:02:05.040" end="01:02:09.200" style="s2">one of the richest men in America. She</p>
<p begin="01:02:07.040" end="01:02:11.359" style="s2">never even recognized him. I&#39;ll take the</p>
<p begin="01:02:09.200" end="01:02:14.160" style="s2">life she wasted. Listen to your teacher</p>
<p begin="01:02:11.359" end="01:02:16.400" style="s2">and have fun.</p>
<p begin="01:02:14.160" end="01:02:18.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that designer? We should connect. It</p>
<p begin="01:02:16.400" end="01:02:20.880" style="s2">was an internal sample. I didn&#39;t pay</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.079" end="01:02:22.799" style="s2">retail. So, it&#39;s a knockoff. People will</p>
<p begin="01:02:20.880" end="01:02:25.040" style="s2">fake anything.</p>
<p begin="01:02:22.799" end="01:02:26.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch my mom&#39;s things.</p>
<p begin="01:02:25.040" end="01:02:28.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We don&#39;t need approval from someone who</p>
<p begin="01:02:26.559" end="01:02:31.760" style="s2">changes manners based on a price tag.</p>
<p begin="01:02:28.960" end="01:02:33.760" style="s2">Are you threatening me? No kids. If</p>
<p begin="01:02:31.760" end="01:02:35.520" style="s2">anyone bullies you, step away, tell a</p>
<p begin="01:02:33.760" end="01:02:39.799" style="s2">teacher, and defend only enough to get</p>
<p begin="01:02:35.520" end="01:02:39.799" style="s2">safe. Never start a fight.</p>
<p begin="01:02:42.480" end="01:02:47.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you?</p>
<p begin="01:02:43.680" end="01:02:47.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m their biological mother.</p>
<p begin="01:02:47.920" end="01:02:50.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then Mara stole somebody&#39;s husband and</p>
<p begin="01:02:49.760" end="01:02:53.119" style="s2">kids.</p>
<p begin="01:02:50.400" end="01:02:54.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She didn&#39;t steal us. She&#39;s our mom.</p>
<p begin="01:02:53.119" end="01:02:56.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She must be manipulative if the kids</p>
<p begin="01:02:54.720" end="01:02:58.559" style="s2">defend her.</p>
<p begin="01:02:56.400" end="01:03:00.799" style="s2">Shh.</p>
<p begin="01:02:58.559" end="01:03:02.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Save the apology. You announced an</p>
<p begin="01:03:00.799" end="01:03:04.000" style="s2">unverified claim in front of parents and</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.480" end="01:03:06.160" style="s2">children. I know exactly what you were</p>
<p begin="01:03:04.000" end="01:03:09.160" style="s2">doing. Knowing doesn&#39;t mean you can stop</p>
<p begin="01:03:06.160" end="01:03:09.160" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="01:03:09.280" end="01:03:13.200" style="s2">I took Brendan from you. Now I&#39;ll take</p>
<p begin="01:03:11.280" end="01:03:15.760" style="s2">Ethan. I&#39;m the twin&#39;s real mother.</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.200" end="01:03:17.280" style="s2">You&#39;re the intruder. You&#39;re weaponizing</p>
<p begin="01:03:15.760" end="01:03:18.799" style="s2">my mother&#39;s death. And children you</p>
<p begin="01:03:17.280" end="01:03:21.119" style="s2">haven&#39;t proved are yours. That is</p>
<p begin="01:03:18.799" end="01:03:21.760" style="s2">shameless. Leave Ethan before I make</p>
<p begin="01:03:21.119" end="01:03:23.599" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:03:21.760" end="01:03:25.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Try.</p>
<p begin="01:03:23.599" end="01:03:25.920" style="s2">A client requested you for an urgent</p>
<p begin="01:03:25.359" end="01:03:27.760" style="s2">project.</p>
<p begin="01:03:25.920" end="01:03:28.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have school pickup. Reassign it or</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.760" end="01:03:31.599" style="s2">move the deadline.</p>
<p begin="01:03:28.720" end="01:03:35.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The client refuses anyone else.</p>
<p begin="01:03:31.599" end="01:03:35.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is the client Sabrina?</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.760" end="01:03:41.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I missed you. I&#39;m taking you home.</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.400" end="01:03:43.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not authorized to pick us up.</p>
<p begin="01:03:41.440" end="01:03:45.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not our mom.</p>
<p begin="01:03:43.200" end="01:03:47.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once I&#39;m Mrs. Cole, I&#39;ll send these two</p>
<p begin="01:03:45.280" end="01:03:50.680" style="s2">away. [music] Mara isn&#39;t coming. Who</p>
<p begin="01:03:47.680" end="01:03:50.680" style="s2">says?</p>
<p begin="01:03:52.400" end="01:03:55.680" style="s2">I thought you left. You used a fake</p>
<p begin="01:03:54.319" end="01:03:57.039" style="s2">project to delay me, then tried to</p>
<p begin="01:03:55.680" end="01:03:58.480" style="s2">remove children you are not authorized</p>
<p begin="01:03:57.039" end="01:04:00.559" style="s2">to pick up. The school is documenting</p>
<p begin="01:03:58.480" end="01:04:04.039" style="s2">this. I only wanted to see them. You saw</p>
<p begin="01:04:00.559" end="01:04:04.039" style="s2">them. We&#39;re leaving.</p>
<p begin="01:04:04.079" end="01:04:07.960" style="s2">I need you to do something.</p>
<p begin="01:04:10.240" end="01:04:14.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you take tomorrow off?</p>
<p begin="01:04:12.319" end="01:04:18.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="01:04:14.000" end="01:04:18.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s Leo and Lily&#39;s birthday.</p>
<p begin="01:04:19.359" end="01:04:23.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow? I haven&#39;t bought gifts.</p>
<p begin="01:04:22.480" end="01:04:24.319" style="s2">I [snorts] planned something for all of</p>
<p begin="01:04:23.680" end="01:04:26.079" style="s2">us.</p>
<p begin="01:04:24.319" end="01:04:27.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A beach day, a licensed boat tour, and</p>
<p begin="01:04:26.079" end="01:04:27.920" style="s2">supervised snorkeling. How did you get</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.599" end="01:04:29.440" style="s2">this?</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.920" end="01:04:30.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My company raffle. I got lucky.</p>
<p begin="01:04:29.440" end="01:04:31.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you handle the kids. I&#39;ll pack.</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.799" end="01:04:33.769" style="s2">Tomorrow will be perfect.</p>
<p begin="01:04:31.749" end="01:04:33.769" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:04:36.559" end="01:04:39.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello.</p>
<p begin="01:04:38.400" end="01:04:40.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You again.</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.520" end="01:04:42.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come tomorrow if you want to see your</p>
<p begin="01:04:40.960" end="01:04:44.240" style="s2">twins on their birthday.</p>
<p begin="01:04:42.559" end="01:04:47.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Send proof they&#39;re safe. Then I&#39;ll come</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.240" end="01:04:49.280" style="s2">to a public place.</p>
<p begin="01:04:47.039" end="01:04:51.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, take them first. I may be late.</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.280" end="01:04:53.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What changed? Dererick says the client</p>
<p begin="01:04:51.520" end="01:04:53.920" style="s2">project can&#39;t wait. I&#39;ll come as soon as</p>
<p begin="01:04:53.039" end="01:04:55.839" style="s2">I&#39;m done.</p>
<p begin="01:04:53.920" end="01:04:59.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, please come.</p>
<p begin="01:04:55.839" end="01:04:59.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:05:00.319" end="01:05:04.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why was Mara denied leave?</p>
<p begin="01:05:03.119" end="01:05:07.440" style="s2">I don&#39;t see a leave request or urgent</p>
<p begin="01:05:04.960" end="01:05:11.400" style="s2">assignment. I&#39;ll ask HR to preserve the</p>
<p begin="01:05:07.440" end="01:05:11.400" style="s2">records and contact her directly.</p>
<p begin="01:05:13.280" end="01:05:19.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come soon.</p>
<p begin="01:05:15.440" end="01:05:19.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will have fun.</p>
<p begin="01:05:25.440" end="01:05:30.960" style="s2">Where are the twins?</p>
<p begin="01:05:27.760" end="01:05:33.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ll come when we&#39;re done talking.</p>
<p begin="01:05:30.960" end="01:05:35.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have you reconsidered marrying me?</p>
<p begin="01:05:33.280" end="01:05:36.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am already married. If you have</p>
<p begin="01:05:35.200" end="01:05:39.720" style="s2">evidence about the children, give it to</p>
<p begin="01:05:36.559" end="01:05:39.720" style="s2">my lawyer.</p>
<p begin="01:05:41.839" end="01:05:50.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The camera saw it and I&#39;m reporting you.</p>
<p begin="01:05:46.000" end="01:05:50.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The sun is going down. Where is she?</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.760" end="01:05:56.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="01:06:00.480" end="01:06:04.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; why are you here?</p>
<p begin="01:06:02.240" end="01:06:07.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s the twins birthday I wanted to</p>
<p begin="01:06:04.000" end="01:06:07.000" style="s2">celebrate.</p>
<p begin="01:06:07.280" end="01:06:11.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They already have their mother coming.</p>
<p begin="01:06:09.440" end="01:06:13.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve waited nearby all day. I stayed</p>
<p begin="01:06:11.440" end="01:06:16.119" style="s2">away while Mara was coming, but she</p>
<p begin="01:06:13.119" end="01:06:16.119" style="s2">isn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:06:20.880" end="01:06:27.960" style="s2">She chose him over the birthday. Let me</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.599" end="01:06:27.960" style="s2">stay so the children have a mother here.</p>
<p begin="01:06:30.559" end="01:06:33.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kids, do you want her here?</p>
<p begin="01:06:31.760" end="01:06:36.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you asking? We don&#39;t even have a</p>
<p begin="01:06:33.680" end="01:06:37.359" style="s2">DNA result. One story and one watch do</p>
<p begin="01:06:36.000" end="01:06:38.480" style="s2">not make her our mother.</p>
<p begin="01:06:37.359" end="01:06:41.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re right. I should have said that</p>
<p begin="01:06:38.480" end="01:06:41.960" style="s2">first. Finally,</p>
<p begin="01:06:44.240" end="01:06:47.240" style="s2">mom.</p>
<p begin="01:06:55.440" end="01:06:58.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You made it</p>
<p begin="01:06:56.640" end="01:07:02.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; barely. Someone tried to steal my</p>
<p begin="01:06:58.960" end="01:07:06.839" style="s2">afternoon and then my family.</p>
<p begin="01:07:02.880" end="01:07:06.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one is taking your family.</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.160" end="01:07:15.440" style="s2">I know this was wrong, but I couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:07:13.200" end="01:07:19.039" style="s2">bear the children</p>
<p begin="01:07:15.440" end="01:07:21.200" style="s2">having no mother at their birthday. No,</p>
<p begin="01:07:19.039" end="01:07:23.680" style="s2">there is no verified parenthood and the</p>
<p begin="01:07:21.200" end="01:07:25.440" style="s2">children said no.</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.680" end="01:07:27.920" style="s2">Their answer matters.</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.440" end="01:07:30.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We want Mara.</p>
<p begin="01:07:27.920" end="01:07:32.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan,</p>
<p begin="01:07:30.640" end="01:07:33.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; she leaves until the test and safety</p>
<p begin="01:07:32.240" end="01:07:37.520" style="s2">review are complete.</p>
<p begin="01:07:33.920" end="01:07:37.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine, I&#39;ll go.</p>
<p begin="01:07:41.680" end="01:07:47.119" style="s2">Happy birthday, my love. Do I have to</p>
<p begin="01:07:44.319" end="01:07:50.079" style="s2">marry Gavin just to reach you?</p>
<p begin="01:07:47.119" end="01:07:51.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are those?</p>
<p begin="01:07:50.079" end="01:07:54.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Matching birth lockers I bought before</p>
<p begin="01:07:51.839" end="01:07:56.559" style="s2">my twins were born.</p>
<p begin="01:07:54.480" end="01:07:57.119" style="s2">Thank you for everything, but maybe we</p>
<p begin="01:07:56.559" end="01:07:58.400" style="s2">should</p>
<p begin="01:07:57.119" end="01:08:00.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t finish that because someone</p>
<p begin="01:07:58.400" end="01:08:06.039" style="s2">threatened you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:00.480" end="01:08:06.039" style="s2">Tell me the truth. May I kiss you?</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.960" end="01:08:11.599" style="s2">What did you do?</p>
<p begin="01:08:09.520" end="01:08:14.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing to betray her, but I may have</p>
<p begin="01:08:11.599" end="01:08:19.640" style="s2">missed what she&#39;s afraid to tell me.</p>
<p begin="01:08:14.720" end="01:08:19.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If she leaves, we go with her.</p>
<p begin="01:08:20.880" end="01:08:25.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would a woman suddenly consider</p>
<p begin="01:08:22.560" end="01:08:28.319" style="s2">divorce? Don&#39;t invent a rival. Ask what</p>
<p begin="01:08:25.759" end="01:08:31.880" style="s2">she&#39;s afraid of. Tell the full truth and</p>
<p begin="01:08:28.319" end="01:08:31.880" style="s2">listen to the answer.</p>
<p begin="01:08:32.239" end="01:08:38.400" style="s2">You think Mara has someone else? No, I</p>
<p begin="01:08:35.520" end="01:08:40.799" style="s2">was wrong to speculate. The cafe footage</p>
<p begin="01:08:38.400" end="01:08:44.120" style="s2">shows a man touching her after she told</p>
<p begin="01:08:40.799" end="01:08:44.120" style="s2">him to stop.</p>
<p begin="01:08:49.040" end="01:08:53.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gavin Price,</p>
<p begin="01:08:51.120" end="01:08:54.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; the cafe preserved video of you touching</p>
<p begin="01:08:53.040" end="01:08:57.960" style="s2">Mara without consent and staging a</p>
<p begin="01:08:54.960" end="01:08:57.960" style="s2">photograph.</p>
<p begin="01:09:01.120" end="01:09:08.279" style="s2">Do not contact or approach her. Further</p>
<p begin="01:09:03.839" end="01:09:08.279" style="s2">violations go to the court and police.</p>
<p begin="01:09:09.199" end="01:09:12.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.400" end="01:09:14.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara&#39;s husband brought lawyers and</p>
<p begin="01:09:12.000" end="01:09:15.520" style="s2">police evidence. I&#39;m done going near</p>
<p begin="01:09:14.640" end="01:09:18.159" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="01:09:15.520" end="01:09:19.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then don&#39;t approach her. Make her come</p>
<p begin="01:09:18.159" end="01:09:22.719" style="s2">to you.</p>
<p begin="01:09:19.920" end="01:09:26.400" style="s2">Tell her the daughter has leukemia and</p>
<p begin="01:09:22.719" end="01:09:28.640" style="s2">only you are an HDLA match.</p>
<p begin="01:09:26.400" end="01:09:30.560" style="s2">I don&#39;t have her daughter. And that is</p>
<p begin="01:09:28.640" end="01:09:32.799" style="s2">medical fraud.</p>
<p begin="01:09:30.560" end="01:09:36.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $200,000.</p>
<p begin="01:09:32.799" end="01:09:39.679" style="s2">I&#39;ll arrange the children and paperwork.</p>
<p begin="01:09:36.880" end="01:09:40.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The man who touched you.</p>
<p begin="01:09:39.679" end="01:09:42.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did he threaten you?</p>
<p begin="01:09:40.799" end="01:09:43.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You thought I wanted him</p>
<p begin="01:09:42.000" end="01:09:47.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; for one stupid minute. Tell me the real</p>
<p begin="01:09:43.920" end="01:09:47.560" style="s2">reason you mentioned divorce.</p>
<p begin="01:09:50.560" end="01:09:55.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gavin claims he is the man from that</p>
<p begin="01:09:52.480" end="01:09:56.880" style="s2">night and has my missing twins. And you</p>
<p begin="01:09:55.280" end="01:09:58.560" style="s2">thought marrying him was the only way to</p>
<p begin="01:09:56.880" end="01:10:02.440" style="s2">reach them?</p>
<p begin="01:09:58.560" end="01:10:02.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was considering it.</p>
<p begin="01:10:02.560" end="01:10:07.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then where do I fit?</p>
<p begin="01:10:05.360" end="01:10:09.199" style="s2">I have been beside you through</p>
<p begin="01:10:07.199" end="01:10:11.840" style="s2">everything and you were going to trade</p>
<p begin="01:10:09.199" end="01:10:14.840" style="s2">yourself without trusting me with the</p>
<p begin="01:10:11.840" end="01:10:14.840" style="s2">truth.</p>
<p begin="01:10:14.973" end="01:10:16.993" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:10:17.440" end="01:10:21.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re your children, too.</p>
<p begin="01:10:22.480" end="01:10:25.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please don&#39;t leave us.</p>
<p begin="01:10:29.199" end="01:10:35.280" style="s2">You were going to divorce Ethan and</p>
<p begin="01:10:31.199" end="01:10:38.320" style="s2">marry Gavin for access to the children.</p>
<p begin="01:10:35.280" end="01:10:40.518" style="s2">He says he controls access. I know it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:10:38.320" end="01:10:42.538" style="s2">wrong, but I can&#39;t abandon them.</p>
<p begin="01:10:40.518" end="01:10:42.538" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:10:43.040" end="01:10:46.239" style="s2">You also can&#39;t hand yourself to an</p>
<p begin="01:10:44.640" end="01:10:50.440" style="s2">extortionist.</p>
<p begin="01:10:46.239" end="01:10:50.440" style="s2">We verify everything first.</p>
<p begin="01:10:51.520" end="01:10:55.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Decide soon. The girl you call Anna may</p>
<p begin="01:10:54.159" end="01:10:57.040" style="s2">not have long.</p>
<p begin="01:10:55.840" end="01:10:59.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="01:10:57.040" end="01:11:01.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come see for yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:10:59.360" end="01:11:03.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This says leukemia.</p>
<p begin="01:11:01.679" end="01:11:07.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She allegedly needs an HLA match stem</p>
<p begin="01:11:03.679" end="01:11:10.320" style="s2">cell donor. Gavin says he matched.</p>
<p begin="01:11:07.120" end="01:11:12.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marry me and I donate.</p>
<p begin="01:11:10.320" end="01:11:15.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If she is your child, this demand is</p>
<p begin="01:11:12.480" end="01:11:15.480" style="s2">monstrous.</p>
<p begin="01:11:18.000" end="01:11:24.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Test me through an accredited lab and</p>
<p begin="01:11:19.840" end="01:11:24.000" style="s2">transfer her records to a real hospital.</p>
<p begin="01:11:32.080" end="01:11:36.849" style="s2">Did I match?</p>
<p begin="01:11:34.320" end="01:11:38.869" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:11:36.849" end="01:11:38.869" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:11:40.880" end="01:11:44.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you want to care for her, why pretend</p>
<p begin="01:11:43.280" end="01:11:47.600" style="s2">you cooked and cleaned?</p>
<p begin="01:11:44.960" end="01:11:48.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I can&#39;t cook and I wanted one</p>
<p begin="01:11:47.600" end="01:11:50.239" style="s2">thing to look competent.</p>
<p begin="01:11:48.960" end="01:11:52.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s still lying.</p>
<p begin="01:11:50.239" end="01:11:55.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re right. I tell her the truth when</p>
<p begin="01:11:52.239" end="01:11:55.640" style="s2">she walks in.</p>
<p begin="01:12:15.360" end="01:12:18.560" style="s2">I hired help for the cleaning and</p>
<p begin="01:12:17.040" end="01:12:21.040" style="s2">dinner.</p>
<p begin="01:12:18.560" end="01:12:22.480" style="s2">I wanted to make tonight easier.</p>
<p begin="01:12:21.040" end="01:12:24.000" style="s2">But I should not pretend I did it</p>
<p begin="01:12:22.480" end="01:12:27.400" style="s2">myself.</p>
<p begin="01:12:24.000" end="01:12:27.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We should divorce.</p>
<p begin="01:12:27.600" end="01:12:31.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t [clears throat] about dinner,</p>
<p begin="01:12:28.560" end="01:12:31.719" style="s2">is it?</p>
<p begin="01:12:35.840" end="01:12:42.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It isn&#39;t that. Gavin showed me a girl he</p>
<p begin="01:12:38.880" end="01:12:45.120" style="s2">claims is Anna. The papers say leukemia.</p>
<p begin="01:12:42.320" end="01:12:48.480" style="s2">He says only he matches and he will</p>
<p begin="01:12:45.120" end="01:12:50.480" style="s2">donate if I marry him.</p>
<p begin="01:12:48.480" end="01:12:52.960" style="s2">The man forged a photograph and violated</p>
<p begin="01:12:50.480" end="01:12:54.880" style="s2">a no contact demand. His medical claim</p>
<p begin="01:12:52.960" end="01:12:57.440" style="s2">cannot be trusted.</p>
<p begin="01:12:54.880" end="01:12:59.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know, but until a real hospital</p>
<p begin="01:12:57.440" end="01:13:00.719" style="s2">disproves it, I can&#39;t risk a child&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:12:59.760" end="01:13:03.520" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="01:13:00.719" end="01:13:06.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Trust me for 24 hours. We&#39;ll verify the</p>
<p begin="01:13:03.520" end="01:13:08.239" style="s2">lab, the doctor, the diagnosis, and the</p>
<p begin="01:13:06.000" end="01:13:11.360" style="s2">children.</p>
<p begin="01:13:08.239" end="01:13:14.159" style="s2">And I need to tell you who I really am.</p>
<p begin="01:13:11.360" end="01:13:15.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for loving us.</p>
<p begin="01:13:14.159" end="01:13:18.239" style="s2">But if that child is mine, I cannot</p>
<p begin="01:13:15.920" end="01:13:21.239" style="s2">abandon her.</p>
<p begin="01:13:18.239" end="01:13:21.239" style="s2">Wait,</p>
<p begin="01:13:30.719" end="01:13:34.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; you packed for Mara?</p>
<p begin="01:13:32.239" end="01:13:35.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, it&#39;s yours.</p>
<p begin="01:13:34.000" end="01:13:38.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We choose Mara.</p>
<p begin="01:13:35.840" end="01:13:43.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you divorce, we stay with her. So,</p>
<p begin="01:13:38.640" end="01:13:43.159" style="s2">Mr. Cole, you can leave.</p>
<p begin="01:13:47.851" end="01:13:49.871" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:13:58.080" end="01:14:01.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your wife and children actually sent you</p>
<p begin="01:13:59.920" end="01:14:05.040" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="01:14:01.920" end="01:14:07.840" style="s2">How do I fix this? Verify the medical</p>
<p begin="01:14:05.040" end="01:14:11.280" style="s2">story. Tell her your identity and give</p>
<p begin="01:14:07.840" end="01:14:14.320" style="s2">her facts instead of another promise.</p>
<p begin="01:14:11.280" end="01:14:17.960" style="s2">If she learns how long I lied, she may</p>
<p begin="01:14:14.320" end="01:14:17.960" style="s2">never forgive me.</p>
<p begin="01:14:23.760" end="01:14:29.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you here?</p>
<p begin="01:14:25.840" end="01:14:31.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard Mara wants a divorce.</p>
<p begin="01:14:29.520" end="01:14:34.320" style="s2">I have always cared about you. Let me be</p>
<p begin="01:14:31.679" end="01:14:36.800" style="s2">there for you and the kids.</p>
<p begin="01:14:34.320" end="01:14:39.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am married.</p>
<p begin="01:14:36.800" end="01:14:42.159" style="s2">Do not turn my family&#39;s crisis into an</p>
<p begin="01:14:39.280" end="01:14:46.679" style="s2">opening for yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:14:42.159" end="01:14:46.679" style="s2">Noah, please see her out.</p>
<p begin="01:14:55.120" end="01:15:02.360" style="s2">Sabrina tried to use our separation. I</p>
<p begin="01:14:57.840" end="01:15:02.360" style="s2">sent her away. No secrets.</p>
<p begin="01:15:02.960" end="01:15:08.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will they like these cookies?</p>
<p begin="01:15:06.080" end="01:15:10.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If they come home, do we still get</p>
<p begin="01:15:08.239" end="01:15:12.480" style="s2">bedtime stories?</p>
<p begin="01:15:10.719" end="01:15:17.587" style="s2">Every one of my children gets a place</p>
<p begin="01:15:12.480" end="01:15:19.607" style="s2">beside me. Love does not run out.</p>
<p begin="01:15:17.587" end="01:15:19.607" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:15:22.800" end="01:15:27.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eli,</p>
<p begin="01:15:24.400" end="01:15:30.560" style="s2">I do not want to lie to her anymore. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:15:27.280" end="01:15:32.560" style="s2">Leo and this is my sister, Lily. What is</p>
<p begin="01:15:30.560" end="01:15:35.760" style="s2">your name?</p>
<p begin="01:15:32.560" end="01:15:38.400" style="s2">Maisy Parker.</p>
<p begin="01:15:35.760" end="01:15:40.080" style="s2">Gavin called you Anna Price. Why is your</p>
<p begin="01:15:38.400" end="01:15:44.120" style="s2">name different?</p>
<p begin="01:15:40.080" end="01:15:44.120" style="s2">Because Gavin is not</p>
<p begin="01:15:59.120" end="01:16:03.040" style="s2">Give me an hour. Council will verify</p>
<p begin="01:16:01.360" end="01:16:06.040" style="s2">guardianship and the clinic records</p>
<p begin="01:16:03.040" end="01:16:06.040" style="s2">lawfully.</p>
<p begin="01:16:15.520" end="01:16:21.400" style="s2">You cannot walk in without permission.</p>
<p begin="01:16:17.920" end="01:16:21.400" style="s2">Mar&#39;s inside.</p>
<p begin="01:16:28.480" end="01:16:32.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you mute me?</p>
<p begin="01:16:29.840" end="01:16:33.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo did. Your admirer can have the</p>
<p begin="01:16:32.080" end="01:16:36.080" style="s2">notifications.</p>
<p begin="01:16:33.440" end="01:16:38.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is no admirer. I sent Sabrina</p>
<p begin="01:16:36.080" end="01:16:40.400" style="s2">away.</p>
<p begin="01:16:38.320" end="01:16:42.000" style="s2">Please do not end our marriage because a</p>
<p begin="01:16:40.400" end="01:16:47.640" style="s2">criminal gave you a deadline.</p>
<p begin="01:16:42.000" end="01:16:47.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am safe here. What I need is proof.</p>
<p begin="01:16:47.920" end="01:16:55.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; May I help you to urgent care?</p>
<p begin="01:16:50.800" end="01:16:55.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You may help me walk. No carrying.</p>
<p begin="01:16:58.320" end="01:17:03.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A mild sprain, ice, compression, and</p>
<p begin="01:17:01.280" end="01:17:06.640" style="s2">rest. Return if pain or swelling</p>
<p begin="01:17:03.360" end="01:17:09.600" style="s2">worsens. I told you it was minor.</p>
<p begin="01:17:06.640" end="01:17:11.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I worry because I love you, but worry</p>
<p begin="01:17:09.600" end="01:17:13.600" style="s2">does not give me the right to decide for</p>
<p begin="01:17:11.120" end="01:17:15.760" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:17:13.600" end="01:17:18.800" style="s2">I have been honest about other women,</p>
<p begin="01:17:15.760" end="01:17:21.199" style="s2">but not about myself.</p>
<p begin="01:17:18.800" end="01:17:24.360" style="s2">If we have any chance, you deserve the</p>
<p begin="01:17:21.199" end="01:17:24.360" style="s2">whole truth.</p>
<p begin="01:17:29.199" end="01:17:34.560" style="s2">Maisy Parker is not Anna Price. Noah</p>
<p begin="01:17:32.400" end="01:17:36.000" style="s2">found her parents and Gavin has no</p>
<p begin="01:17:34.560" end="01:17:37.600" style="s2">children.</p>
<p begin="01:17:36.000" end="01:17:40.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Council confirmed it through lawful</p>
<p begin="01:17:37.600" end="01:17:43.120" style="s2">public records. The clinic cannot verify</p>
<p begin="01:17:40.400" end="01:17:46.000" style="s2">the lab report it gave Mara.</p>
<p begin="01:17:43.120" end="01:17:48.719" style="s2">You asked to see me.</p>
<p begin="01:17:46.000" end="01:17:51.280" style="s2">Did you finally come to your senses?</p>
<p begin="01:17:48.719" end="01:17:53.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You used two vulnerable children and</p>
<p begin="01:17:51.280" end="01:17:55.360" style="s2">forged a medical emergency to coersse</p>
<p begin="01:17:53.440" end="01:17:57.520" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="01:17:55.360" end="01:17:59.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maisy&#39;s parents are cooperating. The lab</p>
<p begin="01:17:57.520" end="01:18:02.880" style="s2">report is false. This conversation is</p>
<p begin="01:17:59.920" end="01:18:05.040" style="s2">being documented with everyone&#39;s notice.</p>
<p begin="01:18:02.880" end="01:18:09.320" style="s2">You cannot prove I planned it.</p>
<p begin="01:18:05.040" end="01:18:09.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then tell the detective who did.</p>
<p begin="01:18:12.960" end="01:18:19.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sabrina Hail paid me. She arranged the</p>
<p begin="01:18:15.840" end="01:18:21.280" style="s2">children, the clinic, everything.</p>
<p begin="01:18:19.600" end="01:18:25.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put that in a signed statement and give</p>
<p begin="01:18:21.280" end="01:18:25.000" style="s2">police every message.</p>
<p begin="01:18:32.239" end="01:18:37.840" style="s2">Gavin gave the police the payment trail</p>
<p begin="01:18:34.480" end="01:18:39.199" style="s2">and your messages.</p>
<p begin="01:18:37.840" end="01:18:39.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do not know what you were talking</p>
<p begin="01:18:39.199" end="01:18:42.320" style="s2">about.</p>
<p begin="01:18:39.920" end="01:18:44.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The detective does.</p>
<p begin="01:18:42.320" end="01:18:45.760" style="s2">Do not contact Mara or the children</p>
<p begin="01:18:44.159" end="01:18:49.520" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="01:18:45.760" end="01:18:51.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. I built the story,</p>
<p begin="01:18:49.520" end="01:18:52.320" style="s2">but I am still the twin&#39;s biological</p>
<p begin="01:18:51.360" end="01:18:54.000" style="s2">mother,</p>
<p begin="01:18:52.320" end="01:18:56.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; and I know where Mara&#39;s missing children</p>
<p begin="01:18:54.000" end="01:18:59.040" style="s2">are.</p>
<p begin="01:18:56.320" end="01:19:02.719" style="s2">Where are they? Convince Ethan to marry</p>
<p begin="01:18:59.040" end="01:19:04.239" style="s2">me and I tell you.</p>
<p begin="01:19:02.719" end="01:19:05.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No,</p>
<p begin="01:19:04.239" end="01:19:07.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; you do not get a marriage in exchange</p>
<p begin="01:19:05.760" end="01:19:11.159" style="s2">for a child&#39;s safety.</p>
<p begin="01:19:07.199" end="01:19:11.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then find them without me.</p>
<p begin="01:19:20.159" end="01:19:24.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, do you love me?</p>
<p begin="01:19:24.400" end="01:19:27.400" style="s2">ision.</p>
<p begin="01:19:28.080" end="01:19:33.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, I love you.</p>
<p begin="01:19:31.280" end="01:19:34.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then would you ever marry Sabrina to get</p>
<p begin="01:19:33.040" end="01:19:38.480" style="s2">my children back?</p>
<p begin="01:19:34.400" end="01:19:40.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, because I love you. I will not turn</p>
<p begin="01:19:38.480" end="01:19:42.960" style="s2">our marriage into currency. We will find</p>
<p begin="01:19:40.960" end="01:19:44.560" style="s2">them without surrendering either of our</p>
<p begin="01:19:42.960" end="01:19:48.120" style="s2">lives.</p>
<p begin="01:19:44.560" end="01:19:48.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I believe you.</p>
<p begin="01:19:50.239" end="01:19:57.120" style="s2">Have you decided?</p>
<p begin="01:19:53.440" end="01:20:01.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, I refuse. I want the truth, but I</p>
<p begin="01:19:57.120" end="01:20:01.239" style="s2">do not own Ethan&#39;s life.</p>
<p begin="01:20:01.860" end="01:20:03.880" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:20:03.920" end="01:20:09.360" style="s2">Eleanor Cole is meeting Mara today.</p>
<p begin="01:20:07.280" end="01:20:11.280" style="s2">She sees her, the old maternity lie</p>
<p begin="01:20:09.360" end="01:20:15.480" style="s2">could collapse.</p>
<p begin="01:20:11.280" end="01:20:15.480" style="s2">Then Mara never reaches Eleanor.</p>
<p begin="01:20:17.520" end="01:20:23.280" style="s2">My grandmother can be direct, but she</p>
<p begin="01:20:19.679" end="01:20:26.920" style="s2">has wanted to meet you for years.</p>
<p begin="01:20:23.280" end="01:20:26.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am not nervous.</p>
<p begin="01:20:37.230" end="01:20:39.250" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:20:51.120" end="01:20:57.199" style="s2">Lily, are you hurt?</p>
<p begin="01:20:54.239" end="01:20:59.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m okay. We hid this because Lily</p>
<p begin="01:20:57.199" end="01:21:03.400" style="s2">thought you might see her as a monster.</p>
<p begin="01:20:59.280" end="01:21:03.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A monster? Never.</p>
<p begin="01:21:18.480" end="01:21:22.480" style="s2">The women in my mother&#39;s line are born</p>
<p begin="01:21:20.080" end="01:21:24.719" style="s2">unusually strong. It passes from mother</p>
<p begin="01:21:22.480" end="01:21:26.400" style="s2">to daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:21:24.719" end="01:21:29.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then Lily may be your biological</p>
<p begin="01:21:26.400" end="01:21:29.400" style="s2">daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:21:32.880" end="01:21:37.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What does it say? The accredited test</p>
<p begin="01:21:35.520" end="01:21:39.840" style="s2">supports maternity for both children at</p>
<p begin="01:21:37.840" end="01:21:42.840" style="s2">greater than 99.99%</p>
<p begin="01:21:39.840" end="01:21:42.840" style="s2">probability.</p>
<p begin="01:21:45.120" end="01:21:50.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo and Lily are the twins I lost.</p>
<p begin="01:21:47.920" end="01:21:54.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, they&#39;re your children.</p>
<p begin="01:21:50.560" end="01:21:54.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom. Mom.</p>
<p begin="01:21:58.451" end="01:22:00.471" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:22:13.600" end="01:22:18.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:22:16.639" end="01:22:21.360" style="s2">5 years ago, someone drugged both of us</p>
<p begin="01:22:18.719" end="01:22:23.760" style="s2">at that hotel. Neither of us could</p>
<p begin="01:22:21.360" end="01:22:25.360" style="s2">consent. Eleanor was later given the</p>
<p begin="01:22:23.760" end="01:22:27.360" style="s2">twins and told me you died in</p>
<p begin="01:22:25.360" end="01:22:29.679" style="s2">childbirth.</p>
<p begin="01:22:27.360" end="01:22:31.840" style="s2">I believed it, so I never searched for</p>
<p begin="01:22:29.679" end="01:22:34.880" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:22:31.840" end="01:22:39.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I forgive you for not knowing. I do not</p>
<p begin="01:22:34.880" end="01:22:41.360" style="s2">forgive the people who built that lie.</p>
<p begin="01:22:39.040" end="01:22:43.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Police found the truck driver. Payment</p>
<p begin="01:22:41.360" end="01:22:45.120" style="s2">records connect the crash to Sabrina.</p>
<p begin="01:22:43.600" end="01:22:46.639" style="s2">She&#39;s been arrested while the</p>
<p begin="01:22:45.120" end="01:22:50.199" style="s2">investigation continues.</p>
<p begin="01:22:46.639" end="01:22:50.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She chose this</p>
<p begin="01:23:01.920" end="01:23:05.280" style="s2">What did you do to my daughter? Sabrina</p>
<p begin="01:23:03.920" end="01:23:07.600" style="s2">was arrested in connection with an</p>
<p begin="01:23:05.280" end="01:23:10.080" style="s2">attempted vehicle assault. Evidence, not</p>
<p begin="01:23:07.600" end="01:23:13.280" style="s2">I, put her there.</p>
<p begin="01:23:10.080" end="01:23:17.600" style="s2">You hate lies? Then ask your husband why</p>
<p begin="01:23:13.280" end="01:23:21.880" style="s2">Ethan Cole, CEO of Apex Meridian Group,</p>
<p begin="01:23:17.600" end="01:23:21.880" style="s2">let you believe he was only a driver.</p>
<p begin="01:23:22.000" end="01:23:25.920" style="s2">Ethan Cole, you&#39;ve been the CEO all</p>
<p begin="01:23:25.199" end="01:23:27.760" style="s2">along.</p>
<p begin="01:23:25.920" end="01:23:29.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara, I can explain.</p>
<p begin="01:23:27.760" end="01:23:32.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Apex headquarters,</p>
<p begin="01:23:29.920" end="01:23:35.040" style="s2">the gala,</p>
<p begin="01:23:32.239" end="01:23:38.639" style="s2">your parents&#39; gifts. I should have seen</p>
<p begin="01:23:35.040" end="01:23:41.280" style="s2">it. Men that rich protect every dollar.</p>
<p begin="01:23:38.639" end="01:23:44.080" style="s2">He hid it because he never trusted you.</p>
<p begin="01:23:41.280" end="01:23:47.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is not true.</p>
<p begin="01:23:44.080" end="01:23:51.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Security escort Miss Hail out.</p>
<p begin="01:23:47.440" end="01:23:51.320" style="s2">No force unless necessary.</p>
<p begin="01:23:59.040" end="01:24:05.120" style="s2">Mom, she was wrong about the money. Dad</p>
<p begin="01:24:02.560" end="01:24:08.440" style="s2">did lie. But there is one document you</p>
<p begin="01:24:05.120" end="01:24:08.440" style="s2">need to see.</p>
<p begin="01:24:09.120" end="01:24:14.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is this? An offer to place the</p>
<p begin="01:24:11.760" end="01:24:17.120" style="s2">marital assets and Ethan&#39;s apex voting</p>
<p begin="01:24:14.159" end="01:24:18.960" style="s2">writers into a family trust</p>
<p begin="01:24:17.120" end="01:24:20.239" style="s2">for me and the children. The lawyers</p>
<p begin="01:24:18.960" end="01:24:23.840" style="s2">drafted it at my request.</p>
<p begin="01:24:20.239" end="01:24:26.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Money was never the wound. The lie was.</p>
<p begin="01:24:23.840" end="01:24:28.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I gave you my real name, but let you</p>
<p begin="01:24:26.239" end="01:24:30.560" style="s2">believe I was a driver. I was afraid</p>
<p begin="01:24:28.400" end="01:24:32.719" style="s2">you&#39;d see the fortune before you saw me.</p>
<p begin="01:24:30.560" end="01:24:35.199" style="s2">Then I met you, and every day I delayed</p>
<p begin="01:24:32.719" end="01:24:39.199" style="s2">became another lie.</p>
<p begin="01:24:35.199" end="01:24:42.080" style="s2">That was cowardly. I am sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:24:39.199" end="01:24:46.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am not signing away my anger. And I am</p>
<p begin="01:24:42.080" end="01:24:48.320" style="s2">not throwing you out. We rebuild slowly</p>
<p begin="01:24:46.239" end="01:24:49.520" style="s2">with no more hidden lives or decisions</p>
<p begin="01:24:48.320" end="01:24:51.520" style="s2">made for me.</p>
<p begin="01:24:49.520" end="01:24:53.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Agreed.</p>
<p begin="01:24:51.520" end="01:24:55.520" style="s2">And when you are ready, may I give you</p>
<p begin="01:24:53.280" end="01:25:00.920" style="s2">the wedding we never had?</p>
<p begin="01:24:55.520" end="01:25:00.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We want to be in it. Both of us.</p>
<p begin="01:25:01.853" end="01:25:03.873" style="s2">[bell and music]</p>
<p begin="01:25:07.440" end="01:25:12.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I finally get to see my son&#39;s wedding.</p>
<p begin="01:25:24.239" end="01:25:31.199" style="s2">No more hiding who I am. No decisions</p>
<p begin="01:25:26.880" end="01:25:32.960" style="s2">made for you. Truth. I choose the truth.</p>
<p begin="01:25:31.199" end="01:25:36.000" style="s2">Especially when it scares me.</p>
<p begin="01:25:32.960" end="01:25:38.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No sacrificing myself in silence. I</p>
<p begin="01:25:36.000" end="01:25:39.920" style="s2">choose you as my partner, not my</p>
<p begin="01:25:38.320" end="01:25:43.440" style="s2">rescuer.</p>
<p begin="01:25:39.920" end="01:25:45.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You may kiss mom now. She said, &quot;Yes, we</p>
<p begin="01:25:43.440" end="01:25:47.759" style="s2">checked.</p>
<p begin="01:25:45.739" end="01:25:47.759" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
